<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na Matei</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matei</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na Matei ya chitabu chimwe mne pfitabu pfine ipfili mne Laghano lya Sambi ipfilonga mbuli tsa Yesu Kiristu. Chila chitabu chokemighwa Injili (mana yake Imbuli Inoghile). Pfitabu apfo tsapfandikighwa na Matei, Maliki, Luka na Yohane. Iwasomi ng'awamanyile bae Imbuli Inoghile ya Matei yandikighwe tsuwachi, lekeni yakoneka tsayandikighwa mne ghumwaka ghwa sitini kulawa Yesu hakalile muisi. Pfipfila ng'ahomanyika ghoya bae hanu hayandikighwe, lekeni iwanu wengi wakwaghitsa yandikighwa Palestina au mne ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imunu yandike Imbuli inoghile ino iye Matei, iyakalile msola kodi ahala Yesu ng'ana amsaghule yawe mtumighwa wake. Pfipfila tsaang'ali yomanyika kwa taghwa lya Lawi. Tsakakala yumwe wa iwanang'ina kumi na weli na tsakawandikila pfilongotsi wa Chiyahudi. Alino lyakoneka mwatsi, mana mne chitabu chino mna mbuli ka sitini itsilawa mne ghamaandiko ghe Laghano lya Ghumwande. Tsakabama kulangusa ka Yesu tsakakala Masiha, Mkombotsi iyasaghulighwe ne Imulungu, iyalongighwe mbuli tsake na manabii. Pfipfila tsakandika mbuli nyingi tsa undewa we Imulungu. Wayahudi tsawalolela Masiya ang'awile mndewa ka iwandewa we iisi. Lekeni Matei kopinga chinu acho kwa kulonga pfinoghile mbuli tse undewa we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli Inoghile yandikighwe na Matei cha chitabu ichinoghile ukwandusila pfitabu pfa Laghano lya Sambi kwaajili ya mbuli tsake nyingi itsilawa mne Laghano lya ghumwande. Cholunga pfinoghile malaghano meli. Iwasomi wakwaghitsa Matei tsakandika ka pfandike Musa mne pfitabu pfake pfitano pfa mwanduso pfa Laghano lya ghumwande. Malangulitso gha Yesu mchidunda, (Matei 5-7) ghodaha ukwighala na Imulungu pfamwing'ile Musa malaghitso. (Kumb 19:3-23:33.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1-4, Matei kakwandusa Imbuli inoghile kwa kulonga mbuli ya ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu Kiristu na mwanduso wa sang'ano yake.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mne isula ya 5-25, Matei kolonga mbuli tsa sang'ano ya Yesu na ghamalangulitso ghake.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 26-28, Matei kolonga mbuli tsa ukufa na ukutsilihuka kwa Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ichitabu cha lukolo lwa Yesu Kiristu, mwana wa Daudi, mwana wa Abrahamu. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abrahamu tsakamweleka Isaka, Isaka kamweleka Yakobu, Yakobu kamweleka Yuda na ndughu tsake, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda kaweleka Peresi na Zera, mamo wawo tsakakala Tamari, Peresi kamweleka Hezironi, Hezironi kamweleka Aramu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Aramu kamweleka Aminadabu, Aminadabu kamweleka Nashoni, Nashoni kamweleka Salumoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salumoni kamweleka Boazi, mai wake Boazi tsakakala Rahabu, Boazi kamweleka Obedi kwa Rutu, Obedi kamweleka Yese; <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese kamweleka Imfalume Daudi, naye Daudi kamweleka Selemani; mai wake Selemani tsaayula iyakalile mwehe wa Uriya. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Selemani kamweleka Rehoboamu; Rehoboamu kamweleka Abiya; Abiya kamweleka Asa; <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa kamweleka Yehoshafati; Yehoshafati kamweleka Yoramu; Yoramu kamweleka Uzia; <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia kamweleka Yothamu; Yothamu kamweleka Ahazi; Ahazi kamweleka Hezekiya; <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya kamweleka Manase; Manase kamweleka Amoni; Amoni kamweleka Yosia; <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia kamweleka Yekonia na ndughu tsake mna ghamatsuwa aghala Wayahudi ghawaghalighwe kuna utumwa isi ya Babilonia.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Wayahudi hawakalile Babeli, Yekoniya kamweleka Shealitieli; Shealitieli kamweleka Zerubabeli; <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabeli kamweleka Abiudi; Abiudi kamweleka Eliakimu; Eliakimu kamweleka Azori; <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azori kamweleka Sadoki; Sadoki kamweleka Akimu; Akimu kamweleka Eliudi; <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi kamweleka Eliazazi; Eliazari kamweleka Matani; Matani kamweleka Yakobu; <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobu kamweleka Yosefu, immale wake Maria, mai wake Yesu, iyokemighwa Kiristu, au Masia. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Apfo kukala na pfeleko kumi na nne kulawa Abrahamu mbaka Daudi; na pfeleko kumi na nne kulawa Daudi mbaka Wayahudi hawaghalighwe akula Babilonia; na pfeleko kumi na nne kulawa Wayahudi hawaghalighwe Babilonia mbaka ukwelekighwa kwa Kiristu.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu Kiristu tsakukala apfino, Maria mai wake Yesu tsakalapfighwa tsengele na Yosefu; lekeni tsang'ana wawase hamwe baye, Mariya koneka kana inda kwa uwetso wa Loho Yelile. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Kwaapfila Yosefu tsakakala munu wa haki, ng'abamile kumghela chinyala baye, apfo kabama yamleke kwa chipfiso. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Hayang'ali yotongelela ichinu acho, malaika wa Imndewa kamlawila mndoto kamlongela, “Yosefu mwana wa Daudi, uleke kupfuka kumsola Maria imwehe wako, kwaapfila inda iyali nayo kaipata kwa uwetso wa Loho Yelile. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Katsakweleka imwana mmale, naghwe kutsomkema taghwa lyake Yesu, kwaapfila yeye katsowakombola iwanu wake na tsinzambi tsawo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ghose aghano ghalawila kutimilitsa aghala ghayalongile Imtwatsa kubitila inabii;<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Lola! Mwali ng'ana yawase na mmale katsokinda inda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">naye katsakweleka mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">nawo watsomkema Imanweli!</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">Mana yake, Imlungu kahamwe na twetwe.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Apfo Yosefu hayalamke katenda apfila imalaika wa Imtwatsa pfayamlongele; kamsola imwehe wake; <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />lekeni ng'awasile naye baye mbaka hayeleke imwanaghe; kamkema litaghwa lyake Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Iwahenza kulawa ubali wa mashariki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu hayoneke kuna ghumji ghwa Betilehemu mna isi ya Yuda, ghamatsuwa aghala Herodi hayakalile imfalume, wanu iwomanya igholawila kwa kulola tsinondo iwalawile ubali wa mashariki watsa Yerusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />waghutsa, “Yalikwani ayula iyelekighwe yawe mfalume wa Wayahudi? Mana tuyona inondo yake ubali wa mashariki, natwe tutsa tumwinamile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Mfalume Herodi hayahulike apfo kaghanzika ng'ani, hamwe na iwanu wose iwali Yerusalemu; <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />naye kawakema hamwe wakulu wa iwatambika na waandishi wa iwanu, kawaghutsa ghutsa wamlongele, “Kiristu yang'oneke kwani?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Wamwidika, “Katsakonekela Betilehemu mna isi ya Yuda, mana pfipfo pfayandikighwe na nabii; <verse eid="MAT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Naghwe Betilehemu, mna isi ya Yuda, ng'uli mdodo baye mna ipfilongotsi wa Yuda, kwaapfila kuna ghweghwe katsolawila mtawala, iyatsakuwa mdimi wa iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Kuya Herodi kawakema hachipfiso awala iwanu iwomanya igholawila kwa kulola tsinondo, kawaghutsa wamlongela ichipindi inondo hailawile. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Kuya kawatuma Betilehemu, kawalongela, “Mghende mkabame ghoya hayali imwana; na mala mng'amwona muye mnilongele ili na nene nighende nikamwinamile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Nawo hawamalitse ukumhulikitsa mfalume walawa woka; na baho, aila inondo yawonile mashariki iwalongolela, mbaka ighenda kwima hanu hayakalile imwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Nawo hawayonile inondo aila, wadeng'elela ghendo. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Hawapfikile, wengila mng'anda, wamwona imwana hamwe na Maria mai wake, nawo wamwinamila, wamuabudu. Kuya wafungula imikoba ya tsihatsina tsawo, wamwing'a nzawadi; nzahabu, upfumba na dawa inoghile iikemighwa manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Kuya woka kuya kuisi yawo kwa nzila ingi, kwaapfila Imlungu kawakanya mndoto waleke kumuyila Herodi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsumila Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Na iwanu awo hawokile, lola, malaika wa Imtwatsa kamlawila Yosefu mndoto kamlongela, “Winuke, umsole imwana na mai wake, mtsumile Misiri. Mkale ako mbaka hanitsokulongela, kwaapfila Herodi kobama yambame imwana yamkome.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Apfo Yosefu kenuka, kamsola imwana na mai wake ichilo chicho, waghenda Misiri. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Naye kakala ako mbaka hayafile Herodi. Ichinu acho chitendeka ili imbuli iyalongile Imtwatsa kubitila nabii itimile, “Kulawa Misiri nimkema imwanangu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wadowado wokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Herodi hayatangile ka iwanu iwomanya igholawila kwa kulola tsinondo wamghutsukila, kona maya ng'ani. Kalapfa laghitso iwana wose iwamale iwali Betilehemu na awala iwali habehi wakomighwe, iwana iwakalile na miyaka mili na awala ing'awapfikile miyaka mili kulawa litsuwa alila iwanu awala hawayonile inondo. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Kuya achila ichilongighwe na nabii Yeremia chitimila, kulonga,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Listi lyohulikighwa ako Rama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">chililo cha usungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Raheli kowalilila iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">naye kolema kukanzighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kwaapfila wose wafa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuya kulawa Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Herodi hayafile, lola, malaika we Imtwatsa kamlawila Yosefu mndoto mna isi ya Misiri, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />kamlongela, “Winuke, umsole imwana na mai wake muye Isiraeli, kwaapfila awala iwabamile kumkoma imwana, wose mala wafa.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Apfo Yosefu kenuka, kamsola imwana na mai wake woya Isiraeli. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Lekeni Yosefu hayahulike Arkelao kotawala hanu ha Herodi aba wake ako Yudea, kapfuka ukughenda ako, na kwaapfila kakanyighwa mndoto, kaghenda kuna ghumkoa ghwa Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />naye kakala mna ghumji ghwa Nazareti; apfo chitimila achila ichilongighwe na nabii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:23">“Katsokemighwa Mnazorayo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatitsa kotangatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Ghamatsuwa agho Yohane Mbatitsa kaghenda yotangatsa mna inyika ya Yudea, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />kalonga, “Msame, mtsileke tsinzambi tsenu kwaapfila Ufalume wa kulanga wahabehi!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Kwa apfila Yohane yuyo imunu iyatabirighwe na nabii Isaya, kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Litsi lya imunu lyokemelea kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Itengenetseni inzila ya Imtwatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">mgholoseleni inzila yake.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Naye Yohane imwenyegho tsakapfala gwanda lya mighala ya ngamiya, na msipi ghwa ngotsi mchuno; na ichijo chake tsachikala nzighe na ukwi wa kumhulo. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Iwanu wamghendela kulawa Yerusalemu, Yudeya yose na kulawa mna isi tsose tsili mbalimbali mwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani; <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />naye kawabatitsa mna ghumto ghwa Yoridani, aku wosama tsinzambi tsawo.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Naye hayawonile wengi mna Mafarisayo na Masadukayo woutsila ubatitso wake, kawalongela, “Mwemwe yamli lweleko lwa moma, nani iyawakanyile muikimbile imaya ikutsa? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Lelo mtende aghala igholangusa ako ukusama kwenu; <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />wala mleke kwipfikitsa kwilongela, 'Twinaye aba wetu, Abrahamu.' Nomlongelani ghendo, kulawa mna ghamabwe aghano. Imlungu kodaha kumwinulila wana Abrahamu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Na ihoya tiyari ikighwa kuna ghamasina gha imibiki, chila mbiki ing'aghukweleka matunda ghanoghile ghwoganighwa na kwasighwa mna ghumoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Ambe nene nowabatitsa kwa ghamatsi kwa ajili ya ukusama, lekeni yeye iyakutsa kuchughu kwangu kana ngupfu kubita nene, mbaka nene sibamighwa baye kudohola imikwabatsa mmaghulu ghake. Ayo katsowabatitsa mwemwe kwa Iloho Yelile na moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Na ilungo lwake lwa ukubetela lwa mmoko mwake, naye katsoliseya ghoya libughano lyake lya ukubetela; na katsoikunga ingano na kuyika mkano, lekeni imikumvi katsoilakatsa mna ghumoto ing'aghutsimika.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobatitsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Malk 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ichipindi acho Yesu kalawa Galilaya, kaghenda kuna ghumto ghwa Yoridani ili Yohane yakambatitse. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Lekeni Yohane tsakabama yamghome, kalonga, “Nene nobamighwa nibatitsighwe na ghweghwe, naghwe konitsila nene?” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yesu kamwidika, “Uleke sambi iwe pfipfo. Kwaapfila pfipfo pfatubamighwa tuitimitse ihaki yose.” Apfo Yohane katoghola. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Yesu hayamalitse ukubatisighwa, bahala kalawa mmatsi. Lola! Lilanga limpfughukila, kamwona Iloho wa Imlungu kohulumka kulonga njiwa na kumtsila mchanya mwake. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Na baho, litsi kulawa kulanga lilonga, “Ayuno Imwanangu yanimkunda, yaninoghelighwa naye.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koghetsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Malk 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Kuya Yesu kaghelusighwa na Iloho Yelile mbaka kunyika yakaghetsighwe na Iyehile. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Naye kafunga ukuja kwa matsuwa alubaini chilo na misi, kuya hambele tsakona nzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Baho Imghetsa kamghendela, kamlongela, “Kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa Imwana wa Imlungu, ghalongele ghamabwe aghano ghawe pfighate.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Naye kedika, kalonga, “Yandikighwa apfino, ‘Imunu ng'atsokala mgima kwa chighate chiliyeka baye, ila kwa chila longa ililawa mumlomo mwa Imlungu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Kuya Iyehile kamsola mbaka kuna ghumji ghwelile, Yerusalemu, kamwika kusa kwa ghumnala ghwa lihekalu. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Kuya kamlongela, “Kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa Imwana wa Imlungu, wiyase hasi, mana yandikighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Katsokulaghitsila wamalaika wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">nawo watsokusola mna ghamoko ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">uleke kwikwala ghumghulu ghwako mna libwe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu kamwidika, “Pfipfila yandikighwa, ‘Uleke kumghetsa Imtwatsa Imlungu wako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Kuya Setani kamsola keli mbaka kuna ichidunda chitali ng'ani, kamlangusa falume tsose tsa isi na ifahali yake, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />na kamlongela, “Ung'enama hambele hangu na kuniabudu, nitsokwing'a ghweghwe aghano ghose.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yesu kamlongela, “Uka Setani! Kwaapfila yandikighwa, ‘Umuabudu Imtwatsa Imlungu wako, na umtumikile yeye yaliyeka!’ ” <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Kuya Setani kamleka Yesu, na wamalaika watsa wamtumikila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwanza kuwapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Malk 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu hayahulike Yohane wamwika mchifungo, koka kaghenda Galilaya; <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />kalawa Nazareti, kaghenda kukala Kaperinaumu, mji ghuli mwani mwa litsimbu lya Galilaya, na ghwibakane na isi ya Zabuloni na isi ya Naftali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Alino litendeka ili chitimile achila chayalongile nabii Isaya,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Isi ya Zabuloni na isi ya Naftali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">inzila ya ibahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">kumwambu kwa Yoridani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya ya iwanu iwali si Wayahudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />“Iwanu iwokala mchisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">wona mwanga mkulu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Nawo awala iwakalile mna isi ya ichimbeho cha lifwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">mwanga ghuwamwemwesela.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kulawa ichipindi acho Yesu kanza kuwatangatsila iwanu, kulonga, “Mtubu, kwaapfila ufalume wa mbinguni wahabehi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema wanafunzi wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Malk 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu hayang'ali yakwanga mmbalimbali mwa litsimbu lya Galilaya, kawona ndughu weli, Simoni iyakemighwe Petiri na ndughu yake Andereya, wakwasa ilwapfu mghati mwa litsimbu, mana wawo tsawalowa somba. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Kawalongela, “Mniwinze, nani nitsowatenda muwe walowa wanu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Bahala watsileka tsinyapfu tsawo, wamuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Hayaghendile hambele chidogho, kawona ndughu wangi weli, Jakobu imwana wa Zebedayo, na Yohane ndughu yake. Tsawakala mna ghumnumbwi hamwe na Sebedayo baba yawo, wotengenetsa tsinyapfu tsawo, naye kawakema. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Bahala waghuleka ghumnumbwi na aba wawo, wamuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa, kopeta na kowahonya iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Naye yang'ali yakwanga Galilaya yose, akuno kolangulitsa mna ghamasinagogi ghawo, na kutangatsa Imbuli Inoghile ya Ufalume wa Imlungu, na kuwahonya iwanu maghonzwa ghose na matamu ghose. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Mbuli tsake tsenela mna isi yose ya Siriya, apfo iwanu wamghalila iwatamu wose, iwoghula utamu wowose, awala iwodununzika, wana ipfinyamkela, iwakufa chisala, na awala iwaholole, naye kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Na iwanu makingiri kwa makingiri wamuwinza kulawa Galilaya, isi ya Dekapoli, Yerusalemu, Yudeya, na isi ili kumwambu mwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela iwanu kuchidunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu hayonile ghamakingili gha iwanu, kagheluka kuchidunda, kakala hasi, na iwanafunzi wake wamtsila; <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />baho kafumbula ghumlomo ghwake, kanza kuwalangulitsa, kulonga, <verse eid="MAT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />Wabweda iwali wahingwa wa iloho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">kwaapfila ufalume wa kulanga wawo.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Wabweda awala wana ihutsuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">kwaapfila watsokanzighwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Wabweda awala iwali wahole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">kwaapfila watsoihala isi.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Wabweda awala wana inzala na ing'ilu ya ukutenda haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">kwaapfila awo watsoghutitswa.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Wabweda iwanu awala wana libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">kwaapfila awo watsakonelighwa libatsi.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Wabweda awala wana imimoyo yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">kwaapfila awo watsomwona Imlungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Wabweda awala iwopatanisha iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">kwaapfila awo watsokemighwa wana wa Imlungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Wabweda awala iwodununzika kwa ajili ya ukutenda haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">kwaapfila awo ufalume wa kulanga wawo.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Mbweda mwemwe iwanu hawatsomligheni na kumdununzeni na kumlongeni chila mbuli ihile kwa ughutsu, kwaajili yangu nene. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Mdeng'e na kudeng'elela; kwaapfila ghweko lyenu kulu kulanga; mana apfo pfipfo pfawawadununze manabii wa ghumwande iwamlongoleleni mwemwe.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunyu na ghumwanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Malk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Mwemwe mwa imunyu ya isi. Lekeni imunyu ing'ahinyika, angu itsoghumighwa choni mbaka ikole keli? Ng'aina sang'ano keli baye, ila yasighwe kunze na iwanu waibajughe.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Mwemwe mwa ghumwanga ghwa isi. Mji ghung'awa mchidando ng'aghudaha kwipfisika baye. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Iwanu ng'awotuwa ichitasa na kuchighubika na iseghe baye, ila wochika mna ichinala, nacho chowamulikila iwanu wose iwali mng'anda. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Pfipfo na mwemwe mleke ghumwanga ghwenu ghumulike hambele ha iwanu, nawo waghone ghamatendo ghenu ighanoghile, wamtunitse Aba wenu iyali kulanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Mleke kufikitsa kuwa nene nitsa kuleghusa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa au ipfitabu pfa manabii wa Imlungu. Sitsile kuleghusa baye, ila nitsa kutimilitsa. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, mbaka lilanga na isi hapfitsohupa, kuduhu helufi imwe wala alama ndodo mna Ghamalaghitso itsoleghusighwa mbaka ghose ghatimile. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Apfo munu wowose iyoleghusa laghitso dodo kulawa mna Ghamalaghitso aghano, na kuwalangulitsa iwanu wangi pfipfo, ayo katsokemighwa mdodo ghendo mna ufalume wa kulanga. Lekeni ayula iyoghakinda Ghamalaghitso na kuwalangulitsa iwanu watende pfipfo, ayo katsokemighwa mkulu mna ufalume wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Mana nomlongelani ghendo, ihaki yenu ana ng'aibita ihaki ya Waandishi na Mafarisayo, mna ufalume wa kulanga ng'amtsokwingila ng'o!<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mhulika iwanu wa ghumwande pfawalongelighwe, ‘Uleke kukoma, na munu wowose yang'akoma katsohighighwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Lekeni nene nomlongelani ghendo, chila munu iyomwonela maya ndughu yake, katsohighighwa. Na ayula iyombetsa ndughu yake katsoghalighwa kuna libalatsa, na ayula iyomkema ndughu yake, ‘Mbotsi,’ ayo katsobamighwa ukwingila mna ghumoto ghwa jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ana ughala inambiko yako hana imatsabahu, kuya kwokumbuka tsakwisonga na ndughu yako, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />uileke inambiko yako hambele ha imatsabahu, ughende tanu ukepatane na ndughu yako, kuya uye uilapfe inambiko yako.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Mwipatane hima na imunu iyokughala kuna libalatsa hamng'ali mwa mnzila, hela ayo katsokughala kwa imlamlitsi, na imlamulitsi katsokughala kwa asikali mkulu, naye katsokwika mchifungo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nokulongela kweli ghendo, ng'utsolawa amwo baye mbaka ulihe sendi ya mwisho.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ughoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mhulika tsailongighwa, ‘Uleke kutenda ughoni.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Lekeni nene nomlongelani, munu wowose iyololesa ipinga kwa kutama, ayo mala katenda naye ughoni mmoyo mwake. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Inenge yako ya kujilo ing'akutenda umtotsele Imlungu, ing'ole uyase kutali naghwe; mana ng'apfu kwaghisa chiungo chako chimwe, kubita kululeka ilukuli lwako lwose lwasighwe mna ghumoto ghwa jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Na ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghung'akutenda umtotsele Imlungu, ghukane ughwase kutali naghwe; mana ng'apfu kwaghisa chiungo chako chimwe, kubita kululeka ilukuli lwako lwose lwasighwe mna ghumoto ghwa jehanamu.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya italaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Malk 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Tsailongighwa, ‘Munu yang'amleka imwehe wake kobamighwa yamwandikile hati ya talaka yamwing'e.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Lekeni nene nomlongelani, Munu wowose iyomleka imwehe wake, na imwehe wake ayo ng'atendile ughoni baye, komtenda yawe mghoni, na imunu iyomkwela ipinga ayo iyalekighwe apfo, naye kotenda ughoni.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya ukwilaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Pfipfila mhulika iwanu wa ghumwande pfawalongelighwe, ‘Uleke kwilaha kwa ughutsu na kuleka kutenda chawilahile, ila wiyohe ukutenda achila chawilahile kwa Imtwatsa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Lekeni nene nomlongelani, Uleke kwilaha ghendo; wala kwa kulanga, kwaapfila acho chicho ichighoda cha ufalume cha Imlungu; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />wala kwilaha kwa isi, kwaapfila acho chicho ichghoda cha ukwikila ghamaghulu ghake; wala kwilaha kwa Yerusalemu, kwaapfila agho ghugho ghumji ghwa Mfalume Mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Wala uleke kwilaha kwa litwi, kwaapfila ng'udaha baye kulutenda lumvili lumwe luwe lutselu au lutitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Lekeni mng'alonga ‘Ona,’ iwe ‘Ona,’ na mng'alonga ‘Baye,’ iwe ‘Baye’; kwa apfila chinu chochose ichibita agho, cholawa kwa ayula Yehile.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nenge kwa nenge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mhulika tsailongighwa, ‘Nenge kwa nenge, na 'tsino kwa tsino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Lekeni nene nomlongelani, mleke kwihisanya na imunu yehile. Imunu yang'akutowa kanza lya kujilo, mhundusile na likanza lya kumoso pfipfila yakutowe. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Na imunu yang'abama kukughala kuna libalatsa ili yasole ligwanda lyako, mlekele na likoti lyako pfipfila yalisole. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Na munu wo wose iyokunanahitsa umdutile mtsigho ghwake kwa utali wa kilomita imwe, ghweghwe mdutile kwa kilomita mbili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Ayula iyokulomba mwing'e; na ayula iyobama kukukopa uleke kumhundusila ichisogho.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkunde aduwi yako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mhulika tsailongighwa, ‘Mkunde munu wa habehi naghwe, na umwihile aduwi yako.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Lekeni nene nomlongelani, muwakunde aduwi tsenu, na muwalombele awala iwomdununzani, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ili muwe wana wa Aba wenu iyali kulanga; kwaapfila yeye kowalangatsila litsuwa lyake iwehile na iwanoghile; na kowatowela imvula wana ihaki na ing'awana ihaki. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Mana mng'awakunda awala iwowakunda mwemwe, mtsopata liho lyachi? Mbona hata iwatotsa kodi pfipfo pfawotenda? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Namwe ana muwalamsa ndughu tsenu waliyeka, mtenda choni chikulu kubita iwanu wangi? Angu iwanu ing'awommanya Imlungu ng'awotenda pfipfo baye? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Muwe watimilifu, kama Aba wenu iyali kulanga pfayali mtimilifu.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kuwapfila iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Mwalangitse, mleke kutenda ighanoghile hambele ha iwanu ili wamloleni; mana mng'atenda apfo, ng'amtsopata liho baye kulawa kwa Aba wenu iyali kulanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Apfo ghweghwe hauweng'a iwahingwa chinu chochose, uleke kutowa malati hambele hako kwilangusa kwa iwanu; kama iwang'enye pfawotenda mna ghamasinagogi na mna tsinzila, ili watunitsighwe na iwanu. Nomlongeleni kweli ghendo, awo tiyari wabokela maliho ghawo ghose. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Lekeni ghweghwe haumwing'a chinu imhingwa, hata ghumoko ghwako ghwa kumoso ghuleke kumanya achila chaghutenda ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo; <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />ili uluso wako wautendile uwe wa chipfiso; na Aba wako iyakona ighapfisike, katsokuliha.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malangulitso gha ukulomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Namwe hamlomba, mleke kwighala na iwang'enye! Kwaapfila wawo watsowela ukulomba akuno wakwima mna ghamasinagogi na mmbalimbali mwa tsinzila, ili iwanu wawone. Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, awo mala wabokela liho lyawo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Lekeni ghweghwe haulomba, wingile mna ichiheleto chako cha mghati, uhinde ghumlango ghwako, ulombe hambele ha Aba wako iyali mchipfiso; naye Aba wako iyakona ighapfisike, katsokuliha.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Hamlomba, mleke kulonga chaka kama wapagani pfowotenda. Kwaapfila wawo wofikitsa wohulikitsighwa kwa ukulongalonga kwawo. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Apfo mleke kwighala nawo; kwaapfila Aba wenu komanya achila chambama ng'ana mwemwe mumlombe. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Lelo mwemwe mlombe apfino:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Aba wetu yuli kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Litaghwa lyako litunyighwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Ufalume wako utse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">ghaubama ghatendeke mna isi kama ako kulanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Utwing'e leloli ichijo chetu cha chila tsuwa,<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Utuleghusile ghamatotso ghetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">kama twetwe pfatuwaleghusila ghamatotso awala iwatutotsele.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Na uleke kutwingitsa mna ghamaghetso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">ila utukinge na ayula Yehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Kwaapfila ufalume wako ghweghwe, na tsingupfu, na utunitso, kwa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. Amina.’<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Kwa apfila, mng'awaleghusila iwanu ghamatotso ghawo, na Aba wenu iyali kulanga pfipfila katsowaleghusilani mwemwe ghamatotso ghenu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Lekeni ana ng'amuwaleghusila iwanu ghamatotso ghawo, naye Aba wenu iyali kulanga ng'atsomleghusilani mwemwe baye ghamatotso ghenu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha ukufunga ukuja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Na hamfunga ukuja, mleke kwighala na iwang'enye iwohutsunika ipfihanga pfawo ili woneke kwa iwanu kuwa wafunga ukuja. Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, awo mala wabokela liho lyawo. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Lekeni ghweghwe haufunga ukuja, wibake ghamapfuta mwitwi mwako, na unawe ichihanga chako, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ili uleke kwoneka kwa iwanu kuwa kufunga, ila yamanye Aba wako yaliyeka yang'akoneka; na Aba wako iyakona ighapfisike katsokuliha.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utajiri uli kulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Mleke kwika tsimali tsenu muisi, amwo ghamabumbuluwa na ing'utu pfotsihinya, na iwahitsi wobomola na kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Lekeni mwike tsimali tsenu kulanga, ako ghamabumbuluwa na ing'utu ng'awotsihinya baye, na iwahitsi ng'awodaha baye ukubomola wala ukwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kwaapfila ahala hana tsimali tsako, baho haghutsokala ghumoyo ghwako.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghumwanga ghwa ilukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Inenge yiyo itala ya ilukuli. Lelo inenge yako ana yelile, ilukuli lwako lwose lutsakuwa na ghumwanga. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Lekeni inenge ako ana yihile, ilukuli lwako lwose lutsakuwa mchisi. Apfo ghumwanga ighuli mghati mwako ghung'awa chisi, acho ambe chisi totolo!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumikila watwatsa weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Haduhu munu iyodaha kutumikila watwatsa weli, kwaapfila katsomwihila yumwe na kumkunda yungi; au katsomuwinza yumwe na kumbetsa yungi. Ng'amdaha baye kumtumikila Imlungu na tsimali.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Apfo lelo nomlongelani, mleke kwalangulila ugima wenu, mja choni au mng'wa choni; wala tsing'uli tsenu, mpfala choni. Angu pfihi, ugima ng'auna samani kubita ipfijo baye? Na ilukuli ng'aluna samani kubita ghamagwanda baye? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Mlole wapfideghe wa kulanga, ng'awohanda baye, wala ng'awopfuna baye, wala kwika mkano; na Aba wenu iyali kulanga kowaghutitsa! Apfi mwemwe ng'amli wa samani ngulu kubita wapfideghe baye? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Yuhi mna mwemwe kwa ukwalangula kodaha ukwongetsa ichimo chake kwa moko ghumwe?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Na kwa ajili ya tsinguo, hebari mkwalangula? Ghaloleni ghamaluwa ighali mmighunda, pfaghokula. Ng'aghotenda sang'ano baye, wala ng'aghofuma. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Na nene nomlongelani kuwa hata Selemani hamwe na utajiri wake wose wa tsimali, ng'apfalile pfinoghile baye ka luwa limwe mna ghamaluwa agho. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Lelo ka Imlungu koipfatsa apfo imitsani ya kubagho, ili baho leloli, na ilupfi yakwasighwa mna litanuli, angu ng'atsompfatsani mwemwe baye, mwemwe yamli na noghola ndodo?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Apfo mleke kwalangula, kulonga, ‘Tuja choni?’ Au ‘Tukunwa choni,’ au ‘Tupfala choni?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kwaapfila iwanu ing'awammanyile Imlungu woghasumbukila agho ghose; lekeni Aba wenu wa kulanga komanya ka mwoghabama agho ghose. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Lekeni mwemwe tanu ubameni ufalume wake na ihaki yake, na agho ghose mtsakwing'ighwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Apfo lelo mleke ukwalangula gha ilupfi, kwa apfila ilupfi itsakwalangula yenyegho. Chila tsuwa lina ighehile ghake, lekani kwongetsa ghangi.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kuwahigha iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Mleke kuwahigha iwanu wangi, hela namwe mtsohighighwa, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />mana apfila pfamuwahigha iwanu wangi, pfipfo namwe pfamtsohighighwa; na ichipimo champimila, chicho iwanu chawatsompimilani mna ukuwahigha mwemwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />“Heule ulola ilupfulu luli mnenge mwa ndughu yako, lekeni ng'ulyona baye libiki lili mnenge mwako ghumwenyegho? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Au udahatse kumlongela ndughu yako, ‘Uleke nikulapfe ilupfulu luli mnenge mwako,’ aku mnenge mwako ghumwenyegho mna biki? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Kwa mng'enye ghweghwe! Tanu yandusa kulapfa libiki lili mnenge mwako, kuya kutsodaha kulola na kwona ghoya ulapfe ilupfulu luli mnenge mwa ndughu yako.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Mleke kuweng'a wambwa achila ichelile; wala mleke kwasa tsilulu tsenu hambele ha wangubi; hela watsotsibajugha kwa ghamaghulu ghawo, kuya wamhundukileni na kumdatsulani.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlombe, mbame, mtowe hodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Mlombe, namwe mtsakwing'ighwa, mbame namwe mtsopata, mtowe hodi, namwe mtsopfughulighwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kwaapfila chila munu iyolomba kobokela, naye iyobama kopata, na ayula iyotowa hodi katsopfughulighwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Au munu wachi mna mwemwe, imwanaghe yang'amlomba chighate, komwing'a libwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Au yang'amlomba somba, komwing'a inzoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Lelo kama mwemwe yamwihile mwomanya ukuweng'a iwanenu nzawadi tsinoghile, angu Aba wenu iyali kulanga ng'atsolumbilitsa baye kuweng'a nzawadi tsinoghile awala iwomlomba? <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Apfo chochose chambama iwanu wamtendeleni, na mwemwe watendeleni pfipfo; kwaapfila acho chicho Itorati ya Musa na ipfitabu pfa manabii pfachilonga.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lango sisili na lango ghatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Mwingile kwa kubitila lilango sisili; kwaapfila lilango lya ukwingilila kutsimu ghatsi, na inzila ighenda ako pfipfila ghatsi; na iwanu wengi ng'ani iwakwingila kwa kubitila inzila ayo. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Lekeni lilango lyasisili, na inzila ilongotsa kuna ugima pfipfila yasisili; na iwanu iwoyona inzila ayo wachidogho ghendo.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki na ghamatunda ghake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Mwalangitse na manabii wa ughutsu; iwomtsilani akuno wapfala magwanda gha ng'olo, lekeni mghati mwawo weghala na wambwa wakali wa kumhulo. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Mtsowatanga kwa ghamatunda ghawo. Angu tsa iwanu wabawagha nzabibu mna imiba, au wabawagha tini mna imichongoma? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Pfipfo, chila mbiki ghunoghile ghwakweleka matunda ghanoghile, lekeni mbiki ghwihile ghwakweleka matunda ghehile. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mbiki ghunoghile ng'aghudaha kweleka matunda ghehile baye; wala mbiki ghwihile ng'aghudaha kweleka matunda ghanoghile baye. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Chila mbiki ing'aghukweleka matunda ghanoghile ghwoganighwa na kwasighwa kuna ghumoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Apfo, kwa ghamatunda ghawo, mtsowatanga manabii wa ughutsu.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwotenda ighehile watsolemighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Si chila imunu iyonikema ‘Mndewa, Mndewa,’ yatsakwingila mna ufalume wa kulanga; ila ayula iyotenda aghala ghayobama Aba wangu yali kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mna litsuwa alila lya ukuhighighwa iwanu, wengi watsonilongela, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa! Pfihi kwa taghwa lyako ng'atutabiri baye, na ng'atulapfile iwanu ipfinyamkela baye kwa taghwa lyako, na kutenda miujitsa mingi kwa taghwa lyako?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Baho nene nitsowalongela mwatsi mwatsi ghendo, ‘Mbe! Mwemwe tsasimmanyileni ghendo baye. Mlawe kuna nene mke, mwemwe imtenda ighehile!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtsenga ng'anda iyakengele na mtsenga ng'anda imbotsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Apfo munu wowose iyotegheletsa ghamalonga ghangu aghano na kughatenda, ayo keghala na imunu iyakengele, yatsengile ing'anda yake mchanya mwa libambalawe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Imvula itowa, ghamatsi ghamema; libeho liduma, liitowa ing'anda aila; lekeni ng'aighwile baye, kwaapfila ilukwalambatsa lwake tsalutsengighwa mna libambalawe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Lekeni chila munu iyotegheletsa ghamalangulitso ghangu aghano na kuleka kughatenda, ayo keghala na imunu mbotsi, iyatsengile ing'anda yake mna ghumsanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Imvula itowa, ghamatsi ghamema, libeho liduma liitowa ing'anda aila, nayo ighwa hasi, puuu!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu hayamalitse ukulonga agho ghose, ghumtingano ghwose ghwa iwanu ghukangawala kwa ghamalangulitso ghake; <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />kwaapfila yang'ali yowalangulitsa kama munu yana ukulu, na si kama iwalangulitsi wawo wa Ghamalaghitso baye.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya imunu yana ukoma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Malk 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu hayahulumke kulawa kuchidunda, mtingano mkulu ghwa iwanu ghumuwinza. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Baho, munu yumwe yana ukoma kamghendela, kamwinamila hambele hake, kamlongela, “Ghwemtwatsa, ung'abama, kwodaha kunitenda nideghete.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu kagholosa ghumoko ghwake, kamkinda imunu ayo, kalonga, “Nobama, haya udeghete!” Bahala imunu ayula kadegheta ukoma wake. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Kuya Yesu kamlongela, “Lola, uleke kumlongela munu wowose; ila ghenda wikelanguse kwa mlapfa nambiko; kuya ulapfe inambiko iyalaghitse Musa, ili iwe ukalangama kuna wawo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola kwa akida wa askali wa Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu hayengile Kaperinaumu, akida yumwe wa askali wa Roma kamghendela, kamlomba, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />kamlongela, “Ghwemtwatsa, mtumwa wangu kaukaye kawasa, kaholola; kuya koghula ng'ani.” <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu kamlongela, “Nitsoghenda kumhonya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Iakida ayo kamwidika, “Ghwemtwatsa, nene sili munu ghendo baye mbaka ghweghwe wingile hasi ha ikano yangu, ila ulonge longa limwe tu, imtumwa wangu katsohona. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kwaapfila hata nene nyikighwa hasi ha utawala, nina askali yaniwalongotsa. Nomuamulu ayuno, ‘Ghenda,’ naye koghenda; na munu yungi, ‘Itsa!’ Naye kakutsa; na imtumwa wangu, ‘Tenda achino!’ Naye kotenda.” <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu hayahulike apfo kakangawala ghendo, kawalongela awala iwamuwinzile, “Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, sina mbone baye munu wowose mna isi ya Isiraeli yana inoghola ng'ulu apfino. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Na nomlongelani ghendo, wengi watsakutsa kulawa mashariki na magharibi, nawo watsokala waje mmetsa hamwe na Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu mna ufalume wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Lekeni iwana wa ufalume watsakwasighwa kunze, kuna ichisi totolo, kuko kutsakuwa na ichililo na ukugeng'eda ghamatsino.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Kuya Yesu kamlongela akida ayula, “Uka, na ghakulawile kama apfila pfautoghole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Kuya saa yiyila imtumwa wake kahona.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohonya wanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Malk 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu hayapfikile ukaye kwa Petiri, kampfika mai mkwe wake Petiri kawasa mchinanda, koghula homa. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Kamkinda ghumoko ghwake na lihoma limlawa; naye kenuka kamtandila ichijo.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nemihe haipfikile, wamghalila iwanu wengi wana ipfinyamkela, naye kapfilapfa ipfinyamkela kwa kupfikembela; kawahonya wose iwakalile watamu; <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />ili achila ichilongighwe na nabii Isaya chitimile, hayalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Yeye kasola ghamaghonzwa ghetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">na kaghabapa ghamatamu ghetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanafunzi wa Yesu pfawobamighwa kuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu hayonile mtingano mkulu ghwa iwanu ghwomtsunguluka, kawalaghitsa wanafunzi wake waloke kumwambu kwa litsimbu. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Baho mwandishi yumwe kamghendela, kamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, nitsokuwinza kokose kwaughenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu kamwidika, “Wambwa wa kumhulo wana mango, na wapfideghe wali mlanga wana pfibali, lekeni imwana wa Adamu kahela hanu ha ukuwasitsa litwi lyake.” <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Mwanafunzi wake yungi kamlongela, “Ghwemndewa, ungaye luhusa tanu mbuke nikamtsike aba wangu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Lekeni Yesu kamlongela, “Uniwinze, waleke iwanu iwafile wawatsike iwanu wawo iwafile.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koikembela inyahemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Malk 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Kuya Yesu kadina mna ghumnumbwi, na iwanafunzi wake wamuwinza. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Bahala ilawila nyahemu ng'ulu mna litsimbu, mbaka ghamawimbi ghang'ali ghakwingila mna ghumnumbwi; lekeni Yesu tsakawasa fofofo. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Wanafunzi wake wamghendela, wamlamsa, walonga, “Gwemtwatsa, utukombole, twotsama!” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Kawedika, “Hebari mpfuka, mwemwe yamli na noghola ndodo?” Kuya kenuka, kaikembela inyahemu na ghamawimbi, baho litsimbu litulia tuli! <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Iwanu wose wakangawala ghendo, weghutsa, “Angu ayu munu wachi? Hata libeho na ghamawimbi pfose pfomhulikitsa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanu weli wana ipfinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Malk 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Naye hayapfikile kumwambu, kuna isi ya Gadara, ketingana na wanu weli wana ipfinyamkela wolawa kuna ghamakabuli; wakala wakali ng'ani mbaka kuduhu munu yadahile kubita inzila ayo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bahala wakemelela, “Angu utubamila choni, ghwemwana wa Imlungu? Pfii kutsa kutudununza ng'ana ichipindi chetu chipfike?” <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Kutali kulawa hanu ahala kukala na kingili kulu lya ngubi wakuja. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Pfinyamkela awo wamlomba Yesu, “Ung'atulapfa, tuluhusu tughende tukawengile wangubi awala.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Kawalongela, “Haya laweni!” Baho wawalawa iwanu awo, wawengila wangubi, na likingili lyose litsumila umhulumko mkali, wengila mna litsimbu, na wose wafa mna ghamatsi. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Lekeni iwadimi wa wangubi awo watsuma, waghenda kuna ghumji. Ako wawalongela iwanu agho ghose, na achila ichiwalawilile iwanu wana ipfinyamkela. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Baho iwanu wose wa ghumji walawa waghenda kwitingana na Yesu; nawo hawamwonile, wamlomba yalawe kuna isi yawo yoke.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yahole.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Malk 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu kadina mna ghumnumbwi, kaloka kumwambu koya kuna ghumji ghwake imwenyegho. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Baho, wamghalila imunu iyaholole kawasa mchilagho. Yesu hayonile ukutoghola kwawo, kamlongela imunu ayula iyaholole, “Ughumighwe ghumoyo mwanangu, nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Bahala waandishi wangi wa Ghamalaghitso welongela. “Imunu ayuno komligha Imlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Naye Yesu kamanya achila chawang'ali wofikitsa, apfo kawaghutsa, “Hebali mfikitsa ighehile mna imimoyo yenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Chihi ichibewe, ukulonga, ‘Nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa,’ au ukulonga, ‘Inuka uke’? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Lelo mwobamighwa mmanye kuwa Imwana wa Adamu kana uwetso muisi wa kuwaleghusila nzambi iwanu.” Kuya kamlongela imunu iyaholole, “Inuka, usole ichilagho chako, uke ukaye yako!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Baho imunu ayula kenuka, koka ukaye yake. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Iwanu hawonile apfino wapfuka, wamtunya Imlungu iyaweng'ile iwanu uwetso awo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Matei.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Malk 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu kalawa hanu aho koka, na hayang'ali yoluta, kamwona munu kakala hasi kototsa ikodi, iyakemighwe Matei. Yesu kamlongela, “Niwinze,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Naye kenuka kamuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu hayakalile hasi yaje ichijo cha nemihe mng'anda, watotsa kodi wengi na iwana tsinzambi watsa na ukuja naye, hamwe na iwanafunzi wake. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafarisayo hawonile apfo, wawaghutsa wanafunzi wake, “Hebari mlangulitsi wenu yakuja na iwatotsa kodi na wana tsinzambi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu hayahulike apfo, kawalongela, “Si iwanu iwali wagima baye iwobama imghanga, ila iwatamu wawo iwobama imghanga. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Lekeni mghende mkelangulitse mana yake imbuli aino, ‘Nobama libatsi, wala si inambiko baye.’ Kwaapfila sitsile kuwakema iwanu wana ihaki baye, ila wana tsinzambi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanafunzi wa Yohana womghutsa Yesu imbuli ya ukufunga.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Malk 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Kuya wanafunzi wa Yohana wamghendela Yesu, wamghutsa, “Heule twetwe na Mafarisayo twofunga, lekeni wanafunzi wako ng'awofunga baye?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi yodahika iwahenza iwalalikighwe kuna ichihungo cha ukukwela walomboletse aku immale iyokwela yang'ali nawo? Mbe! Ng'aidahika baye. Lekeni litsuwa litsakutsa immale iyokwela hayatsosolighwa kulawa kuna wawo, baho watsofunga.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Kuduhu munu iyakwika chilaka cha nguo ya sambi mna lighwanda lya ghumwande; kwaapfila ichilaka acho chitsokwegha tsinyutsi tsa ligwanda lya ghumwande, na ahala ihadegheke hatsakongetseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Wala iwanu ng'awoghuma dipfai ya sambi mna ipfibuyu pfa ngotsi pfa ghumwande baye; wang'atenda apfo, ipfibuyu pfitsotulika na idipfai itsakwitika; na ipfibuyu pfitsohinyika. Ila woghuma dipfai ya sambi mna ipfibuyu pfa ngotsi pfa sambi; kuya pfose, idipfai na ipfibuyu pfitsakuwa pfigima.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imndele iyafile na ipinga imtamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Malk 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Hayang'ali yowalongela agho, mkulu wa sinagogi yumwe kamghendela, kamwinamila, kalonga, “Mwanangu mndele kafa sambi ghendo; lekeni utse wike ghumoko ghwako mlukuli lwake, naye katsakuwa mgima keli.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu kenuka, koka kelongotsa naye, hamwe na iwanafunzi wake.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Baho, pinga yumwe iyang'ali yoghula utamu wa kulawa idamu kwa miyaka kumi na mili kamtsila Yesu kuchughu, kakinda lipindo lya ligwanda lyake. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Mana tsakelongela imwenyegho mmoyo mwake, “Ning'akinda ligwanda lyake tu, baho nitsohona.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu kahunduka kamwona ipinga ayo, kamlongela, “Mwanangu, ughumighwe moyo mkulu! Ukutoghola kwako kukuhonya.” Bahala ipinga ayo kahona.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Kuya Yesu kapfika kuna ing'anda ya imkulu ayula wa lisinagogi, naye kona awala iwotowa tsifilimbi, na mtingano ghwa iwanu iwaghanzike; <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />kawalongela, “Mke ahano, imndele ng'afile baye, ila kawasa!” Lekeni wawo wamseka ng'ani. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ghumtingano ghwa iwanu haghulapfighwe kunze, Yesu kengila mng'anda, kamkinda ghumoko, na kamwinula imndele ayula. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Na imbuli aino yenela mna isi aila yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya pfifita weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu koka kulawa hanu ahala; na hayang'ali kamzila pfipofu weli wamuwinza, akuno wokemelela, “Utwonele libatsi, ghwemwana wa Daudi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu hayapfikile kung'anda, wapfipofu awala wamghendela; Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi mwoamini kuwa nene nodaha kuwahonya?” Wedika,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">“Ona, ghwe Mtwatsa!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Kuya kakinda tsinenge tsawo, kalonga, “Iwalawile kama pfamuamini!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Bahala tsinenge tsawo tsidaha ukwona. Yesu kawaghoma ghendo, kalonga, “Mwalangitse, munu wowose yaleke kumanya aghano.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Lekeni wawo woka, wenetsa tsimbuli tsake mna isi aila yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya ichibubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Hawang'ali wakuka, wanu wamghalila Yesu imunu chibubu yana ichinyamkela; <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />na ichinyamkela hayalapfighwe, ichibubu ayula kandusa ukulonga. Iwanu wose wakangawala, walonga, “Ng'ana chilawile baye chinu kama achino mna isi ya Isiraeli!” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Lekeni Mafarisayo walonga, “Kolapfa pfinyamkela kwa uwetso uyakwing'ighwa na imkulu wa ipfinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowonela libatsi iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Naye Yesu yang'ali yotsunguluka mna imiji yose na ipfijiji pfose, kolangulitsa mna ghamasinagogi ghawo, na kuwapetela Imbuli Inoghile ya Ufalume; na kuwahonya iwanu chila utamu na maghayo ghose. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Yesu hayaghwonile ghumtingano ghwa iwanu, kawonela libatsi, kwaapfila tsawepfa na kupwililika kama ng'olo iwalihela mdimi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Kuya kawalongela iwanafunzi wake, “Ghamapfuno mengi, lekeni iwatenda sang'ano wachidogho. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Apfo mumlombe Imtwatsa wa ghamapfuno, yaghale iwatenda sang'ano kuna ghamapfuno ghake.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Wanafunzi kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Malk 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu kawakema hamwe wanafunzi wake kumi na weli, kaweng'a uwetso wa ukulapfa ipfinyamkela, na ukuhonya chila utamu na maghayo ghose. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Aghano ghagho ghamataghwa gha iwatumighwa kumi na weli; wa kwanza Simoni iyakemighwe Petiri, na Andereya indughu yake; Yakobu na indughu yake Yohana, iwana wa Sebedayo. <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipi na Batalomayo, Tomasi, na Matei, iyakalile mtotsa uhshulu; na Yakobu imwana wa Alifayo, na Tadei, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni Mkananayo, na Yuda Iskarioti, iyamsaliti Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma mitume kumi na weli.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Malk 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Mitume awo kumi na weli Yesu kawatuma, kawalaghitsa, “Mleke kughenda kwa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi baye, wala kuna mji ghwoghwose ghwa Wasamariya mleke kwingila. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ila mghende kwa wang'olo iwaghile wa isi ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Namwe hamghenda, tangatseni mlonge, ‘Ufalume wa kulanga wa habehi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Muwahonye iwatamu, muwatsihilule iwafile, muwadeghetetse iwakoma, mlapfe ipfinyamkela. Mwemwe mbokela hela, apfo namwe mlapfe hela. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mleke kusola nzahabu, wala fetsa, wala shaba mna ipfibindo pfenu; <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Mleke kusola mkoba ghwa ghumwanza, wala magwanda meli, wala mikwabatsa, wala ing'weku ya ukwikongoja. Kwaapfila mtenda sang'ano kolihighwa iposho yake.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Mna ghumji ghwoghwose au chijiji chochose chamkwingila, mbame imunu yanoghile, mkale mng'anda mwake mbaka hamtsakuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Namwe mng'engila mna ing'anda, ilamseni; <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />ana wali ghoya iwenyekaye, indamso yenu itsokala nawo, lekeni ana ng'awali ghoya baye, indamso yenu itsowoyila muwenyegho. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Na imunu yang'alema ukumbokelani, au ukutegheletsa ghamalangulitso ghenu, hamlawa mna ing'anda ayo, au mna ghumji aghwo, kung'useni litimbwisi lili mmaghulu mwenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, itsakuwa ng'apfu Imlungu kuidudumila isi ya Sodoma na Gomora mna litsuwa lya ukuhighighwa, kubita ghumji aghwo.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukudununzika kwa iwanafunzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Malk 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Lolani, nene nomtumani kama ng'olo haghati ha wambwa wa kumhulo. Apfo mwobamighwa mkengele kama nzoka na muwe wahole kama njiwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mwiyalangitse na iwanu, kwaapfila watsomghaleni mna ghamabalatsa gha imiji, na mna ghamasinagogi ghawo watsomfapulani. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Namwe mtsoghalighwa hambele ha maliwali na wafalume kwaajili yangu, ili muwe ukalangama kuna wawo, na kwa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi baye. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Lekeni hamtsoghalighwa ako, mleke kwalangula chamtsolonga choni, kwaapfila mtsakwing'ighwa cha ukulonga mna isaa yiyo; <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />mana si mwemwe baye yamlonga, ila Iloho wa Aba wenu yeye iyatsolonga mghati mwenu.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Na ndughu katsomsaliti ndughu yake yakomighwe; na baba katsomsaliti imwanaghe, nawo iwana watsowasaliti baba tsawo na kuwakoma. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Namwe iwanu wose watsomwihilani kwaajili ya litaghwa lyangu; lekeni ayula iyatsodudumila mbaka mwisho yuyo yatsokombolighwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Hamtsodununzighwa mna ghumji aghuno, tsumileni mji ghungi; nomlongelani kweli ghendo, ng'amtsoimalitsa baye imiji ya Isiraeli ng'ana Imwana wa Adamu yatse.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mwanafunzi ng'ombita imlangulitsi wake baye; wala imtumwa ng'ombita imtwatsa wake baye. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Yotosha imwanafunzi kuwa kama imlangulitsi wake, na imtumwa kuwa kama imtwatsa wake. Ana wamkemile imbala wa ing'anda Belizebuli, apfi iwanu iwali mng'anda mwake ng'awatsokemighwa mataghwa ghehile ng'ani baye?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuhi wa ukumpfuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Apfo mleke kuwapfuka, kwaapfila kuduhu chochose ichighubikighwe, ing'achitsoghubulighwa; wala ichipfisike ing'achitsomanyika. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Achila chanimlongelani mchisi, mwemwe chilongeni mna ghumwanga; na achila chamhulika mchpfiso, mwemwe chidalamkeni mchiswili. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mleke kuwapfuka awala iwokoma ilukuli lekeni ng'awodaha baye kuikoma iloho; ila mumpfuke ayula iyodaha kupfihinya pfose, ilukuli hamwe na iloho mna ghumoto ghwa jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Apfi sangalala weli ng'awoutsighwa kwa tobole limwe baye? Wala hata yumwe ng'olaghala hasi baye bila Aba wenu kumanya. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Lekeni mwemwe, hata tsimvili tsili mwitwi mwenu tsose tsipetighwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Apfo mleke kupfuka; mwemwe mwachinu chikulu ng'ani kubita wasangalala wengi!<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtoghola na kumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Apfo chila munu iyonitoghola nene hambele ha iwanu, na nene pfipfila nitsomtoghola hambele ha Aba wangu iyali kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Lekeni munu wowose iyonibela nene hambele ha iwanu, na nene nitsombela hambele ha Aba wangu iyali kulanga.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitsile kuwatenda iwanu watseghembale baye, ila nighala lipanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12:51-53</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Mleke kupfikitsa nene nitsa kuwatenda iwanu watseghembale muisi. Mbe! Sitsile kuwatenda iwanu watseghembale baye, ila nighala lipanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kwaapfila nitsa kuwatenda wesonge, imunu na aba wake, ineghe na mai wake, mwalipfala na mwalipfala wake. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Na iwanu wehile wa imunu watsakuwa iwanu wa mkaye yake.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Iyomkunda aba wake au mai wake kubita nene, ayo si wangu baye; wala iyomkunda imwanaghe au ineghe wake kubita nene, ayo si wangu baye. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Na imunu yang'osola ghumsalaba ghwake na kuniwinza, ayo ng'odaha kuwa wangu baye. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Imunu iyobama kuukindilitsa ugima wake katsowaghisa, lekeni iyouhinya ugima wake kwaajili yangu nene, ayo katsoupata.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghweko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Malk 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Ayula iyombokelani mwemwe, konibokela nene, na ayula iyonibokela nene, kombokela ayula iyanitumile. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Iyombokela inabii kwaapfila nabii, ayo katsobokela liho lya nabii; naye iyombokela imunu yana ihaki kwaapfila kana haki, ayo katsobokela liho lya imunu yana ihaki. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Na munu wowose iyatsomwing'a hata chikombe cha ghamatsi ighopfegha yumwe wa iwadodo awano kwaapfila ayo koniwinza nene, nomlongelani kweli ghendo, liho lyake ng'alitsakwagha baye.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu hayamalitse ukuwatuma wanafunzi wake kumi na weli, kalawa hanu aho kaghenda kulangulitsa na kuwapetela iwanu mna imiji yawo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Lelo, Yohana iyakalile mchifungo hayahulike aghala ghayotenda Kiristu, kawatuma wanafunzi wake, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />wamghutse, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa ayula iyakutsa, au tumlolele yungi?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu kawedika, kawalongela, “Ghendeni mkamlongele Yohana aghano ghamhulika na ghamkona; <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />ipfipofu wakona, ipfimbete woghenda, na wana ukoma wodeghetetsighwa, ipfitsiwi wohulika, iwafile wotsihiluka, na iwahingwa wopetelighwa Imbuli Inoghile. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Kabweda imunu ayula yang'ombonela nene mashaka!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Iwanu iwalawile kwa Yohana hawang'ali wakuka, Yesu kandusa kuwalongela iwanu mbuli tsa Yohana, “Hamghendile kunyika, mghendile kulola choni? Lulanzi iluhighisighwa na libeho? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ana si pfipfo baye, mghendile kulola choni? Imunu iyapfalile magwanda gha bei ng'ulu? Mlole, iwopfala ghamagwanda gha bei ng'ulu wokala mna tsing'anda tsa wafalume. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Lekeni tsahebari mlawile mkamwone nabii? Ona, nomlongelani ghendo, yeye mkulu kubita nabii. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ayuno yuyo iyandikighwe aghano. ‘Lola, nomtuma msenga wangu yakulongolele; iyatsokutandila inzila yako hambele hako.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nomlongelani ghendo, mna iwanu wose iwelekighwe na wamapinga, ng'ana yoneke munu wowose iyali mkulu kubita Yohana Mbatitsa; lekeni iyali mdodo ghendo mna ufalume wa kulanga kamkulu kubita yeye. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kulawa ghamatsuwa gha Yohana Mbatitsa mbaka sambi ufalume wa kulanga wopatikana kwa ngupfu, na iwanu wana ingupfu wouboka. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kwaapfila manabii wose, na Ghamalaghitso gha Musa watabiri mbaka ichipindi cha Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Na ana mbama ukutoghola, yeye yuyo Eliya iyalongighwe katsakutsa. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yeye yana ghamaghutwi yahulike!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Apfi iwanu wa ilweleko aluno niwalinga na choni? Weghala na iwana wadodo iwokala kuna lisoko, iwowakema wayawo, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />wolonga, ‘Tuwatowela ipfimbeta, lekeni ng'ambighile baye! Tuwembila wila tsa lifwa, lekeni ng'amlomboletse baye!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kwaapfila Yohana katsa, ng'akuja wala ng'akung'wa baye, wamlonga, ‘Kana chinyamkela!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Lelo Imwana wa Adamu katsa, yeye kakuja na kakung'wa, nawo walonga, ‘Mumlole imunu ayuno, kana basu, na mlepfi, sale yawo iwototsa ushulu na wana tsinzambi.’ Lekeni hekima yakoneka yotenda ghoya kwa tsisang'ano tsake.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi itsilema kutoghola tsitsochona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Baho Yesu kandusa kuikembela imiji aila myatendile miujitsa yake mingi, kwaapfila ng'ailekile tsinzambi baye. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Kutsochona ghweghwe Korazini! Kutsochona ghweghwe Betisaida! Kwaapfila imiujitsa itendeke kuna mwemwe ing'atendeke Tiro na Sidoni, tangu mwande ghendo wang'alekile tsinzambi tsawo kwa kupfala maghunila na kwibaka lipfu. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Lekeni nomlongelani ghendo, itsakuwa ng'apfu mna litsuwa lya ukuhigha kwa Imlungu kuidudumila imiji ya Tiro na Sidoni kubita mwemwe! <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Naghwe Kaperinaumu! Apfi kwitsakwinulighwe mbaka kulanga? Baye, kutsohulumsighwa hasi mbaka kutsimu. Kwaapfila kama imiujitsa itendeke kuna ghweghwe tsaitendeka Sodoma, ghumji aghwo ghung'akalile baho mbaka leloli! <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Lekeni nokulongela, mna litsuwa lya ukuhigha, Imlungu katsoghududumila ghumji ghwa Sodoma kubita ghweghwe!”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtse kuna nene mbwihile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Mida yiyo Yesu kalonga, “Nokutunya ghwe Aba, Imtwatsa wa kulanga na isi, kwaapfila kuwapfisa ipfinu apfino iwanu wana ihekima na iwakengele, kuwaghubulila iwana iwadodo. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ona, Baba, mana apfino pfipfo pfaikunoghele.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Nying'ighwa pfinu pfose na Aba wangu. Wala haduhu iyommanya Imwana, ila Baba, na haduhu iyommanya Baba, ila Imwana; na wowose ayula Imwana iyobama kumghubulila.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Mtse kuna nene, mwemwe mwose imghanzika na imdununzighwa na mitsigho mitsito, na nene nitsowatula mbwihile. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mwiyohe inila yangu, mwilangulitse kuna nene, kwaapfila nene namhole, kuya na mwenyepfale wa ghumoyo, namwe mtsobwihila mna imimoyo yenu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kwaapfila inila yangu ileghela, na ghumtsigho ghwangu mbewe.”<figure style="fig" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Wang'ombe weli iwohighwe inila ya ukulimila msingo</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Imtwatsa wa Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Malk 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ghamatsuwa agho, Yesu kabita mna imighunda ya ingano mna litsuwa lya Sabato, wanafunzi wake wakala na nzala yakwawa, apfo wandusa kugana imikungwi na kuja ingano. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mafarisayo hawonile apfo, wamlongela, “Lola, iwanafunzi wako wotenda chinu ichighomighwe ukutenda mna litsuwa lya Sabato.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi ng'amsomile baye achila chiyatendile Daudi, hayakalile na nzala, yeye na wayaghe iyakalile nawo? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Pfayengile mna ing'anda ya Imlungu, yeye na wayaghe, kaja ipfighate pfa ukulolesighwa, hata kama tsamwiko yeye ukupfija, wala kwa wayaghe, ila iwabamighwe ukupfija tsaiwatambika waliyeka. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Apfi ng'amsomile baye mna Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, kuwa mna litsuwa lya Sabato iwatambika mna lihekalu wolibetsa litsuwa lya Sabato, lekeni ng'awakwoneka ka watotsa baye? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Lekeni nomlongelani, ahano hana iyali mkulu kubita lihekalu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Ghamaandiko gholonga, ‘Nobama libatsi, na si tsinambiko baye.’ Tsamng'amanyile mana yake choni, ng'ambamile kuwahigha baye iwanu iwalihela totso. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Kwaapfila Imwana wa Adamu yuyo Imtwatsa wa Litsuwa lya Sabato.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunu yana ghumoko ighuholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Malk 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu koka hanu aho, kengila mna lisinagogi lyawo, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />baho tsakukala na munu yumwe yana ghumoko ighuholole. Wamghutsa, walonga, “Apfi ng'aighomighwa baye kumhonetsa imunu mna litsuwa lya Sabato?” Wamghutsa apfo ili wapate imbuli ya ukumghoghela.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Kawalongela, “Apfi munu yuhi kuna mwemwe yana ing'olo yumwe, na ing'olio ayo yang'engila mwipondo mna Litsuwa lya Sabato, yang'atsomkwegha yamlapfe kunze?” <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Imunu kana samani kubita ing'olo mala ngapi? Apfo ng'aighomighwa baye kutenda ighanoghile mna litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Kuya kamlongela imunu ayula, “Gholosa ghumoko ghwako.” Kaghugholosa, nagho ghuhona, ghuwa mgima kama ghumoko ghwake ghungi. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Baho Mafarisayo walawa kunze, weka tsengwe lya apfila pfawatsomkoma.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imtumighwa iyasaghulighwe na Imlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yesu hayaimanyile imbuli ayo, koka hanu ahala, na wanu wengi wamuwinza. Naye kawahonya wose; <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />kuya kawaghoma waleke kuwalongela iwanu wangi mbuli tsake. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Tsakatenda apfo ili achila ichilongighwe na nabii Isaya chitimile, hayalongile,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Ayuno mtumighwa wangu yanimsaghule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">yanimkunda, na iyonideng'elesa ghumoyo ghwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Nitsoghuma Iloho yangu mchanya mwake;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">naye katsotsipetela isi tsose ukuhigha kwangu.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Ng'atsesonga wala ukudalamka;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">wala kuduhu munu iyatsohulika litsi lyake mnzila.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Ghumlanzi ighuhondeke ng'atsoghubena baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">wala utambi wa itala iulapfa liyosi ng'atsoutsima baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">mbaka yaitende haki itawale.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Na litaghwa lyake isi tsa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi baye watsehuwila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Malk 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Kuya wamghalila munu yumwe iyakalile na chinyamkela naye tsachipofu na chibubu, naye kamhonya, mbaka kadaha ukulonga na ukwona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Iwanu wa likingili lyose wakangawala, walonga, “Angu ayuno si imwana wa Daudi baye?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Lekeni Mafarisayo hawahulike apfo, walonga, “Imunu yuno kolapfa pfinyamkela kwa ukwapfilighwa na Belizebuli, mkulu wa ipfinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Naye Yesu hayamanyile chawang'ali wofikitsa kawalongela, “Chila ufalume wipinga iwenyegho utsohinyika; na isi au ikaye ipinga yenyegho ng'aidaha kwima baye. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Na Setani yang'amlapfa Setani, ayo kepinga imwenyegho. Lelo ufalume wake utsakwimatse? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Na nene ning'alapfa ipfinyamkela kwa ngupfu tsa Belizebuli, iwana wenu wopfilapfa kwa ngupfu tsa nani? Apfo lelo awo iwana wenu wawo iwatsomhighani. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Lekeni kwa apfila nene nolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa Iloho wa Imlungu, mmanye kama ufalume wa Imlungu mala uwatsila.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Au imunu yodahatse kwingila mna ing'anda ya imunu yana ingupfu na kumboka ipfinu pfake, bila kwandusa ukumwoha imunu ayo yana ingupfu? Baho lelo hayatsodaha ukuboka ipfinu pfa ing'anda yake.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Imunu ka ng'ali hamwe na nene baye, ayo konibiduka, na imunu ing'ayokunga na nene, ayo kopwililisa. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Apfo nomlongelani, chila nzambi na kufulu iwanu watsoleghusighwa; lekeni kwa ukumkufulu Iloho ng'awatsoleghusighwa baye. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Munu wowose iyomlonga pfihile Imwana wa Adamu katsoleghusighwa inzambi yake, lekeni ayula iyomlonga pfihile Iloho Yelile ng'atsoleghusighwa baye inzambi yake mna ghamatsuwa aghano, wala mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki na ghamatunda ghake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Ghutendeni ghumbiki ghunoghe na ghamatunda ghake ghanoghe, au ghutendeni ghumbiki ghwihe na ghamatunda ghake ghehe; kwaapfila mbiki ghwotangika kwa ghamatunda ghake. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Mwemwe muwana wa nzoka, apfi mdahatse kulonga ighanoghile na mwemwe muwenyegho mwiha? Kwaapfila ghumlomo gwa imunu ghwolonga achila ichimmemile mna ghumoyo ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Imunu yanoghile mmoyo kolapfa ipfinu ipfinoghile kulawa mna ihatsina ya ipfinu ipfinoghile; na imunu yehile, kulawa mna ihatsina ya ipfinu pfihile kolapfa ipfinu pfihile.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Apfo nomlongelani ghendo, kwa chila chinu chihile chawolonga iwanu, watsohighighwa mna litsuwa lya ukuhigha iwanu. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Mana kwa aghala ghaulonga kutsopata haki, na pfipfila kwa aghala ghaulonga kutsohighighwa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitango cha Yona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Malk 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Baho waandishi wamwe na Mafarisayo wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, twobama twone chitango kuna ghweghwe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Kawedika, “Lweleko lwihile na lwa ughoni lwobama chitango! Lekeni ng'alutsakwing'ighwa chitango baye ila ichitango cha nabii Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Mana kama apfila Yona pfayakalile munda mwa isomba mkulu matsuwa madatu chilo na misi, pfipfo Imwana wa Adamu pfayatsokala matsuwa madatu chilo na misi mna ghumoyo ghwa isi. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Iwanu wa Ninawi watsakwima na iwanu wa ilweleko aluno mna litsuwa lya ukuhigha, na watsowahigha; kwaapfila wawo tsawasama ghamatotso ghawo hawapetelighwe na Yona; na ahano hana iyali mkulu kubita Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Malikiya wa kusini (wa Sheba) katsakwima na iwanu wa ilweleko aluno mna litsuwa lya ukuhigha, naye katsowahigha; kwaapfila yeye tsakatsa kulawa ubali wa utsighilo wa iduniya, kutegheletsa ihekima ya Selemani; na ahano hana iyali mkulu kubita Selemani.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuya kwa ichinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Chinyamkela hayomlawa imunu, kakwangakwanga muisi isakale kobama hanu ha ukubwihila, na ng'opata hanu baye; <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />kuya kelongela imwenyegho, ‘Nakuya kuna ing'anda yangu kwanilawile,’ na hayakuya na kuyona ing'anda yahela chinu, iseyighwa na ikighwa ghoya; <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />baho kakuka na kusola pfinyamkela wangi saba iwehile kubita yeye, nawo wakwingila na kukala amwo. Na imunu ayo hali yake ya keli itsakuwa iha kubita ya mwanduso. Apfo pfipfo pfaitsakuwa kwa ilweleko aluno lwihile.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamo wake na ndughu tsake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Malk 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu hayang'ali yolonga na ghumtingano, lola, mai wake na ndughu tsake wapfika, wema kunze, wobama walonge naye. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Apfo munu yumwe kamlongela, “Mai wako na ndughu tsako wakunze, wobama walonge naghwe.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Kedika, kamlongela imunu ayula, “Nani yali mai wangu? Nani wali ndughu tsangu?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Kuya kagholosa ghumoko kuna iwanafunzi wake kalonga, “Awano wawo mamo tsangu na ndughu tsangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kwaapfila munu wowose iyosang'ana achila chayobama Aba wangu wa kulanga, ayo yuyo ndughu yangu, lumbu lyangu, na mai wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya imunu iyohanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Litsuwa lilila Yesu kalawa mna ing'anda aila kaghenda mmbalimbali mwa litsimbu, ako kakala hasi. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Mtingano mkulu ghwa iwanu ghumtsunguluka, mbaka kadina mna ghumnumbwi na kukala amwo, na iwanu wose wema mmbalimbali mwa litsimbu. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Kawalongela pfinu pfingi kwa mifano, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Hulikitseni! Kukala na munu yumwe iyaghendile kuhanda tsimbeghu tsake. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Hayang'ali yopwililisa tsimbeghu, tsingi tsilaghalila habehi na inzila, wapfideghe watsa watsija. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Tsingi tsilaghalila hana ghamabwe na lidongo chidogho, tsota himahima. Kwaapfila lidongo ng'alighendese hasi baye, <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />litsua halilawile, imimeya iholola; na kwaapfila yahela mitsitsi, isakala. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Na mbeghu tsingi tsilaghalila mna imisonga; imisonga ikula, ipfingilila imimeya. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Na tsingi tsilaghalila mna lidongo linoghile, tseleka, imwe mia imwe, imwe sitini, na ingi selathini. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yana ghamaghutwi yahulike!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichimtenda Yesu yalonge kwa mifano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Malk 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Wanafunzi wake watsa wamghutsa, “Heule ulonga nawo kwa mifano?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Kawedika, “Mwemwe mwing'ighwa uwetso wa kutsimanya siri tsa ufalume wa kulanga, lekeni wawo ng'aweng'ighwe baye. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kwaapfila munu wowose yana ichinu, katsakongetsighwa ghendo; na ayula iyalihela chinu, hata achila chayalinacho katsobokighwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Achino chicho ichinitenda nilonge nawo kwa mifano; kwaapfila wang'alola ng'awakona baye, wang'ategheletsa ng'awohulika wala ng'awomanya baye. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Na utabiri wa nabii Isaya wotimila kuna wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Ukuhulika mtsohulika, lekeni ng'amtsoelewa baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Ukwona mtsakona, lekeni ng'amtsotanga baye.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Mana imimoyo ya iwanu awano ifubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">kwa ghamaghutwi ghawo ng'awohulika ghoya baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na tsinenge tsawo wafinyilitsa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">hela watsakona kwa tsinenge tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na kuhulika kwa ghamaghutwi ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na kuelewa mna imimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na kunihundukila nene niwahonye.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Lekeni mwemwe mbweda! Kwaapfila tsinenge tsenu tsakona na ghamaghutwi ghenu ghohulika. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Mana nomlongelani kweli ghendo, manabii wengi na iwanu wana ihaki tsawabama ng'ani wone achila chamkwona mwemwe, lekeni ng'awonile baye, na ukuhulika achila chamhulika mwemwe, lekeni ng'awahulike baye.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalongela mana ya ghumfano ghwa imunu iyohanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Lelo mtegheletse mana ya ghumfano ghwa imunu iyohanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Chila munu iyohulika imbuli ya ufalume lekeni ng'oielewa baye, Yehile kakutsa koboka achila ichihandighwe mghati mwake. Ayo keghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile habehi na inzila. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Na ayula iyahandighwe mna lidongo lina ghamabwemabwe yuyo imunu iyohulika imbuli na bahala koibokela kwa ndeng'elelo; <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />lekeni kwaapfila kahela mitsitsi, kodudumila kwa chipindi chidodo, maghayo na kudununzika pfing'atsa kwaajili ya imbuli aila, baho komleka Imlungu. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Naye iyahandighwe haghati ha imisonga yuyo imunu ayula iyohulika imbuli, lekeni ukusumbukila ugima auno, na ukubugha kwa utajili kwoihinya imbuli ayo, mbaka ng'odaha kweleka matunda baye. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Lekeni iyahandighwe mna lidongo linoghile yuyo imunu ayula iyohulika imbuli ayo na kuielewa; kuya kakweleka ghamatunda, ayuno mia imwe, na ayuno sitini, na yungi selathini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano ghwa misinde haghati ha tsingano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Kawalongela keli mfano ghungi, kalonga, “Ufalume wa kulanga weghala na imunu yahandile mbeghu inoghile mna ghumghunda ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Lekeni iwanu hawawasile, aduwi yake katsa, kahanda imisinde mghati mwa ingano, kuya koka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ingano hayotile na kwandusa ukweleka, imisinde nayo yoneka mna ingano. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Iwatumwa wake imwenyekaye wamghendela wamlongela, ‘Ghwe mtwatsa, apfi ng'uhandile mbeghu inoghile baye mna ghumghunda ghwako? Lelo imisinde liipatile kulawa kwani?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Kawedika, ‘Aduwi yuyo iyatendile apfo.’ Iwatumwa wake wamghutsa, ‘Pfihi kwobama tughende tukaing'ole?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Kalonga, ‘Baye,’ kwaapfila hamng'ola imisinde, mtsoing'ola hamwe na ingano. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Pfilekeni pfose pfikule hamwe mbaka ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna, aho nitsowalongela awala iwopfuna, ‘Tanu mkunge imisinde, muyohe makinzamakinza mkaghasome, lekeni ingano muikunge mkayike mkano mwangu.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano ghwa imbeghu ndodo ya haradali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Malk 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Kawalapfila mfano ghungi, kalonga, “Ufalume wa kulanga weghala na imbeghu ya haradali, iyasolile imunu na kuihanda mumghunda mwake; <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />nayo ndodo kubita mbeghu tsose; lekeni ing'amela, yakuwa ng'ulu kubita imimeya yose ya kumghunda, yakuwa mbiki; mbaka wapfideghe iwali mlanga wakutsa, wotsenga pfibali mna ghamaputila ghake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano ghwa hamila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu kawalongela keli mfano ghungi, “Ufalume wa kulanga weghala na hamila iyasolile ipinga na kuihanganya mna pishi ndatu tsa usaghe, mbaka wose usasa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulangulitsa kwa imifano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Malk 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Agho ghose Yesu kaghulongela ghumtingano kwa mifano, wala bila mfano ng'alongile nawo chinu chochose baye; <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />ili litimile alila liyalongile nabii, kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Nitsofumbula ghumlomo ghwangu kwa mifano;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Nitsoghalonga aghala ighapfisike kulawa isi hayanduse kuwa baho.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mana ya ghumfano ghwa imisinde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Kuya Yesu kaghuwagha ghumtingano ghwa iwanu, kengila mng'anda; wanafunzi wake wamghendela, wamlongela, “Tulongele ghumfano ghwa imisinde kuna ghumghunda ghulangulitsa choni.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Kawedika, “Iyohanda tsimbeghu tsinoghile Mwana wa Adamu; <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Ghumghunda yiyo isi; tsimbeghu tsinoghile, iwana wa ufalume; na imisinde, iwana wa ayula Yehile; <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />iaduwi iyaihandile, Setani; ghamapfuno, utsighilo wa iduniya; na awala iwopfuna, wamalaika. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Apfo kama apfila imisinde pfaikungighwa na kulakatsighwa mmoto, pfipfo pfaitsakuwa mna utsighilo wa iduniya. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Imwana wa Adamu katsowatuma malaika wake, wawakunge kulawa mna ufalume wake awala wose iwohonza wayawo watende nzambi, na awala iwotenda ghehile. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Nawo watsowatupa mna ghumoto; na ako kutsakuwa na chililo na kughegheda ghamatsino. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ichipindi acho iwanu wanoghile watsong'ala kulonga litsuwa mna ufalume wa Aba wawo. Yana ghamaghutwi, yahulike.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano ghwa hatsina ipfisike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Ufalume wa kulanga weghala na hatsina ipfisike mna ghumghunda, na imunu hayonile, kaipfisa; na kwa ndeng'elelo ng'ulu iyali nayo kaghenda kautsa pfinu pfose pfayali napfo, kaghughula ghumghunda aghula.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano ghwa lulu inoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Pfipfila ufalume wa kulanga weghala na mchulutsi iyobama lulu inoghile; <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />naye hayonile lulu imwe ya bei ng'ulu, kaghenda kautsa pfinu pfose pfayali napfo, kaighula.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano ghwa lwapfu lwa ukulowela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Pfipfila ufalume wa kulanga weghala na nyapfu yasighwe mna ibahari, ikunga somba wa chila namna. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Haimemile, waikwegha mbaka kuna ufukwe wa ibahari, wakala hasi na kusaghula wasomba, iwanoghile waweka mpfiseghe, awala iwehile wawatupa kutali. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Apfo pfipfo pfaitsakuwa mna utsighilo wa iduniya; malaika watsakutsa na kuwabaghula awala iwehile na kuweka kutali kulawa awala wana ihaki; <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />na kuwasa mna litanulu lya ghumoto; na ako kutsakuwa na chililo na kughegheda ghamatsino.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hatsina ya sambi na ya ghumwande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi mwoghamanya aghano ghose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Wamwidika, “Ona.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Naye kawalongela, “Apfo chila mwandishi iyalangulitsighwe ghamahala gha ufalume wa kulanga keghala na imunu yana ing'anda, iyolapfa kulawa mna ihatsina yake ipfinu pfa sambi na pfa ghumwande.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemighwa ako Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Malk 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu hayamalitse ukuwalongela imifano aino, kalawa koka hanu aho, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />koya ukaye yake, kawalangulitsa mna lisinagogi lyawo; na hawamhulike wakangawala, weghutsa, “Apfi yaipatile kwani ihekima aino na imiujitsa aino? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Ayuno si imwana wa iselemala baye? Mamo wake si Mariya baye? Na ndughu tsake si tsina Jakobu, Yosefu, Simoni na Yuda baye? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Na lumbu tsake wose ng'awalibaha na twetwe baye? Lelo yaghapatile kwani aghano ghose?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Apfo wambetsa. Lekeni Yesu kawalongela, “Nabii ng'oleka kupata heshima baye, ila mna isi yake, na mkaye yake imwenyegho.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Apfo ng'atendile miujitsa mingi baye ako, kwaapfila ng'awamtoghole baye.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yohana Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Malk 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho, mfalume Herodi kahulika tsimbuli tsa Yesu; <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />naye kawalongela iwatumishi wake, “Ayo Yohana Mbatitsa, katsihiluka kulawa kuna lifwa; lelo tsingupfu atso tsosang'ana mghati mwake.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Kwaapfila Herodi tsakamghogha Yohana, kamwoha na kumwika mchifungo, kwaajili ya Herodiya, mwehe wa Filipi, indughu yake; <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />kwaapfila Yohana tsakamlongela Herodi, “Ng'apfinoghile baye ghweghwe kumkwela ipinga ayo!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Herodi yang'ali yobama yamkome Yohana, lekeni yang'ali yopfuka iwanu, kwaapfila tsawamwona kuwa nabii.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Mna ichihungo cha ukwelekighwa kwake Herodi, neghe Herodiya kabigha hambele ha iwanu, kamnoghelesa Herodi, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />mbaka kamlongela kwa kwilaha kuwa katsomwing'a chochose chayolomba!<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Naye aku kokomangitsighwa na mai wake, imwana ayo kalonga, “Ungaye bahano mlungo litwi lya Yohana Mbatitsa.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mfalume kasing'inika ng'ani, lekeni kwaapfila tsakelaha hambele ha iwagheni wake iwang'ali wakuja ichijo hamwe naye, kalaghitsa yeng'ighwe; <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />apfo kalaghitsa Yohana yaganighwe litwi ukula kuna ligeletsa. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Litwi lyake lighalighwa mlungo, keng'ighwa i mndele ayo, naye kamghalila mamo wake. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Wanafunzi wake waghenda walusola ilukuli lwake, walutsika; kuya waghenda wamlongela Yesu imbuli ayo.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a ichijo wanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu hayahulike achila ichilawile, kalawa hanu aho koka kwa mnumbwi, yaliyeka, kaghenda hanu halihela wanu. Na ghumtingano ghwa iwanu hawahulike, wamuwinza kwa maghulu kulawa mna imiji yawo. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Hayahulumke mna ghumnumbwi, kona mtingano mkulu ghwa iwanu, kawonela libatsi, kawahonya iwaghonzwa wawo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Nemihe haipfikile, wanafunzi wake wamghendela, wamlongela, “Hanu ahano nyika iliyeka, na litsuwa liswa, lelo uwaleke iwanu woke waghende mna ipfijiji wakeghulile ipfijo waje.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Lekeni Yesu kawalongela, “Ng'awobamighwa woke baye, weng'eni mwemwe ichijo waje.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Wamwidika, “Ahano ng'atuna chinu baye, ila pfighate pfitano pfiliyeka, na somba weli.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Naye kawalongela, “Ngalileni ahano ipfinu apfo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Kuya kawalaghitsa iwanu wakale hasi mna imitsani. Kasola ipfighate apfila pfitano na wasomba weli, kalola kulanga, kapfibaliki; kapfibena ipfighate apfila, kaweng'a wanafunzi wake, nawo wawagholela iwanu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Iwanu wose waja, weghuta. Na iwanang'ina wake wadondola ipfighate ipfisighale, wamemesa kapo tsimemile kumi na mbili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Nawo iwajile tsawang'ali wopfika wamale elufu tano, bila kupeta wapinga na iwana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda mchanya mwa ghamatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Malk 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Kuya kawananahitsa wanafunzi wake wadine mna ghumnumbwi wamlongolele kuloka kumwambu, yeye hayang'ali yowagha ghumtingano. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Hayamalitse ukuwagha ghumtingano, kagheluka kuchidunda yaliyeka kughenda kulomba. Nemihe haipfikile, kakala kuko yaliyeka. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Na ghumnumbwi mala tsaghupfika kutali na ufuo wa ibahari, ghwotowighwa na ghamawimbi, kwaapfila tsakukala na beho lyoduma.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Haipfikile nzamu ya kane ya ichilo, habehi na ukucha, Yesu kawaghendela, aku koghenda kwa maghulu mchanya mwa ghamatsi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Wanafunzi wake hawamwonile koghenda mchanya mwa ibahari, wapfuka, walonga, “Mtsimu!” Wadamilila kwa kupfuka.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Lekeni bahala, Yesu kawalongela, “Mhole ghumoyo, ambe nene! Mleke kupfuka!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petiri kamwidika, “Ghwemtwatsa, ana uli ghweghwe, nilaghitse nitse kuna ghweghwe mchanya mwa ghamatsi.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Kamlongela, “Itsa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Petiri kahulumka mna ghumnumbwi, kaghenda mchanya mwa ghamatsi kumghendela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Lekeni hayonile libeho pfaliduma, kona wogha, kandusa kutsama; kadalamka kalonga, “Ghwemtwatsa, nilopole!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Bahala Yesu kagholosa ghumoko ghwake, kamkinda; kamlongela, “Ghweghwe munu yuna imani ndodo, hebari upfuka?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Nawo hawadinile mna ghumnumbwi, libeho lileka ukuduma. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Na awala iwakalile mna ghumnumbwi, wamwinamila, walonga, “Kweli ghendo, ghweghwe kwa Imwana wa Imlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya imtamu ako Genesareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Malk 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Hawalokile litsimbu wapfika kuna isi ya Genesareti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Na iwanu iwali mna isi aila hawamtangile Yesu, watsenetsa mbuli tsake mna isi tsose tsili habehi, apfo wamhilikila wose iwakalile watamu; <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />na wamlomba wadonze hela imindo ya ligwanda lyake. Na wose iwalidonzile wahona ghendo.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Ichelile na ichihile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Malk 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Kuya Mafarisayo na waandishi kulawa Yerusalemu wamghendela Yesu, wamghutsa, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Hebari wanafunzi wako ng'awokinda baye ipfihendo pfa iwahenga wetu? Mana hawakuja ng'awonawa baye ghamoko ghawo!” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu kawedika, kawalongela, “Mbona na mwemwe ng'amkinda baye ghamalaghitso gha Imlungu, ila mwowinza ipfihendo pfenu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kwaapfila Imlungu kalonga, ‘Umheshimu aba wako na mai wako,’ na ‘Imunu wowose iyomligha aba wake au mai wake ayo ukufa nayafe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Lekeni mwemwe mwolonga, ‘Iyatsomlongela aba wake au mai wake, Chochose chanili nacho ichidaha kukwapfila acho nomlapfila Imlungu,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />aho imunu ayo ng'obamighwa kumtegheletsa aba wake baye. Apfo mwolibetsa laghitso ya Imlungu kwa kuwinza ipfihendo pfenu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Mwemwe mwa wang'enye! Nabii Isaya tsakatabili ghoya, hayalongile,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Iwanu awano woniheshimu kwa imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">lekeni imimoyo yawo yakutali na nene.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Woniabudu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">aku welangulitsa malangulitso ighali malaghitso gha iwanu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aghala ighomtenda imunu yehe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Malk 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Kuya kaghukema ghumtingano ghwa iwanu, kawalongela, “Mtegheletse na mpfimanye! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ichimtenda imunu yehe si achila ichikwingila mumlomo mwake baye, ila achila ichilawa kunze mwa ghumlomo, acho chicho ichimtenda yehe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Kuya wanafunzi wake wamghendela wamghutsa, “Apfi komanya ka Mafarisayo hawahulike chaulongile wekwala, wona maya?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Kawedika, “Chila mti ing'aghuhandighwe na Aba wangu iyali kulanga ghutsong'olighwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Walekeni, awo pfilongotsi pfipofu iwolongotsa pfipofu; na chipofu yang'amlongotsa chipofu miyaghe, wose weli watsokuluwila mpondo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petiri kedika, kamlongela, “Tulongele mana yake ghumfano aghuno.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu kalonga, “Apfi mbaka sambi hata mwemwe mng'ali mwahela tsimbutsi? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Ng'ammanyile baye ka chila chinu ichikwingila mumlomo chobitila munda, kuya cholapfighwa choghenda kucholo? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Lekeni achila ichilawa mumlomo, cholawa mna ghumoyo; na acho chiho ichimtenda imunu yehe. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kwaapfila mghati mwa ghumoyo gholawa mawatso ghehile, ukukoma, ughoni, uashelati, uhitsi, ukalangama wa ughutsu, na maligho. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Aghano ghagho ighomtenda imunu yehe; lekeni ukuja bila kunawa ghamoko ng'akumtenda imunu yehe baye.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuamini kwa ipinga Mkananayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Malk 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu koka hanu ahala, kaghenda kuna ghumkowa ghwa Tiro na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Baho, pinga yumwe Mkananayo iyang'ali yokala mna isi ayo kamghendela aku kokemelela, kalonga, “Ghwemtwatsa, Mwana wa Daudi, mbonela libatsi! Imwanangu kana chinyamkela chomghogha ng'ani.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Wala yeye ng'amwidike chochose baye. Nawo wanafunzi wake wamghendela, wamlomba, “Mleke yoke, kwaapfila kotuwinza yokemelela kuchughu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Kedika, kalonga, “Nene situmighwe kwa wanu wangi baye, ila kwa wang'olo iwaghile wa ing'anda ya Isiraeli.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Ipinga ayula kamghendela na kamwinamila hambele hake, kalonga, “Ghwemtwatsa, nyapfile!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Naye kedika, “Ng'apfinoghile baye ukusola ichijo cha iwana na kuwasila wambwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Ipinga kalonga, “Ona, Ghwemtwatsa, lekeni hata wambwa wakuja ipfijo ipfilaghala mmetsa mwa imtwatsa wawo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Baho Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweipinga, imani yako ng'ulu! Leka ghakulawile ka pfaubama.” Bahala imwanaghe kahona.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu koka hanu ahala, kaghenda mmbalimbali mwa litsimbu lya Galilaya. Kuya kagheluka kuchidunda, kakala hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Mtingano mkulu ghwa wanu ghumghendela na kumhilikila ipfimbete, na ipfipofu, na ipfibubu, na iwanu iwaholole, na iwanu wengi iwoghula; wamwikila hambele hake hamaghulu, naye kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Iwanu wakangawala hawonile ipfibubu wolonga, iwaholole wohona, ipfimbete woghenda, na ipfipofu wakona; nawo wamtunitsa Imlungu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a ichijo wanu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Malk 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu kawakema wanafunzi wake, kawalongela, “Noghwonela libatsi ghumtingano, kwaapfila wakala na nene kwa matsuwa madatu, na wahela chaukuja. Kuya sibama niwaleke woke na inzala baye, hela watsotsilika mnzila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Wanafunzi wake wamghutsa, “Tudaha kupata kwani, kunyika akuno kwatuli, pfighate pfingi pfa kuwetsa kuweng'a ghumtingano ghwose aghuno waje?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu kawaghutsa, “Mna pfighate pfingapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Wamwidika, “Saba na somba wadowado chidogho.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Kalaghitsa ghumtingano ghwa iwanu wakale hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Kapfisola ipfighate apfila saba na wasomba, kapfibaliki, kapfibena kaweng'a wanafunzi wake, nawo wanafunzi wawagholela iwanu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Wose waja weghuta; wadondola pfihande pfa pfighate ipfisighale pfikapo pfimemile saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Nawo iwajile wapetighwa, tsaiwamale waliyeka wakala elufu nne, bila kupeta wamapinga na iwana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Kuya kawaleka iwanu woke, yeye kadina mna ghumnumbwi, kaghenda kuna isi ya Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Mafarisayo womlomba Yesu yatende miujitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Malk 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Mafarisayo na Masadukayo wamghendela Yesu, wamghetsa kwa kumlomba yawonese chitango kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yesu kawedika, kalonga, “Litsuwa halikuswa, mwolonga, ‘Kutsonogha, kwaapfila kulanga kudung'u.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na nemitondo mwolonga, ‘Leloli kutsakuwa na nyahemu, kwaapfila lilanga dung'u na libingu litegha.’ Mwodaha ukutanga kulanga pfakuli, lekeni ng'amdaha baye ukumanya ipfitango pfa ghamatsuwa aghano gha utsighilo. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Lweleko lwihile na ing'aluamini, lwobama chitango! Lekeni ng'alutsakwing'ighwa chitango baye, ila achila ichitango cha Yona.” Kuya kawaleka, koka.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Malk 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Wanafunzi wake waloka kumwambu mwa litsimbu, nawo tsawesemwa ukusola pfighate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mwalangitse, mwilolese na ihamila ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Wandusa ukwighutsa iwenyegho kwa iwenyegho, kulonga, “Kolonga apfino kwaapfila ng'atughalile pfighate baye.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Naye Yesu katanga achila chawang'ali wolonga, apfo kawaghutsa, “Hebari mwilongalonga muwenyegho, mwemwe yamna imani ndodo, kwaapfila mwahela pfighate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Angu ng'ana mmanye baye? Pfihi ng'amkumbuka baye ipfighate apfila pfitano kwa iwanu elufu tano, na pfikapo pfingapi pfa ipfihande ipfisighale? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Na ipfighate apfila saba kwa iwanu elufu nne, na pfikapo pfingapi ipfisighale? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Hebali ng'ammanya ka sing'ali nilonga mbuli tsa ipfighate baye, hanilongile, Mwilolese na ihamila ya Mafarisayo na Masadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Baho hawamanyile ka tsang'awalongele welolese na ihamila ya ipfighate baye, ila na ghamalangulitso gha Mafarisayo na Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri komtanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Malk 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu kaghenda kuna isi ya Kaisariya Filipi, ako kawaghutsa iwanafunzi wake, kalonga, “Apfi iwanu wolonga Imwana wa Adamu yali nani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Wamwidika, “Wanu wangi wolonga Yohana Mbatitsa, wangi Eliya, wangi Yeremiya au yumwe wa manabii.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Kawaghutsa, “Na mwemwe, mwolonga nene nili nani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petiri kamwidika, kalonga, “Ghweghwe kwa Kiristu, Imwana wa Imlungu iyali na ugima!”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu kamwidika, kalonga, “Kubweda ghweghwe Simoni, mwana wa Yona, kwaapfila ilukuli na idamu ng'apfikughubulile alino baye, ila Aba wangu iyali kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Na nene nokulongela, ghweghwe kwa Libwe, na mchanya mwa libambalawe alino nitsolitsenga likanisa lyangu, na ghamalango gha kutsimu ng'aghatsodaha kulihinya baye. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Nani nitsokwing'a tsipfughulo tsa ufalume wa kulanga; chochose chautsofunga muisi chitsofungighwa kulanga, na chochose chautsodohola muisi, chitsodoholighwa kulanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Kuya kawaghoma wanafunzi wake waleke kumlongela munu wowose ka yeye yuyo Kiristu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga imbuli yake ya kughaya na ukufa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Malk 8:31–9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kulawa matsuwa agho Yesu kandusa kuwalongela iwanang'ina wake mwatsimwatsi, “Nobamighwa nighende Yerusalemu na kudununzika ng'ani mna ghamoko gha iwabala na iwakulu wa iwatambika, na iwakwandika Ghamalaghitso. Kuya nitsokomighwa, lekeni mna litsuwa lya kadatu nitsotsihiluka.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Petiri kamsola Yesu hambalimbali kandusa kumkembela, “Baye, ghwe Mtwatsa! Agho ng'aghatsokupata baye!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yesu kahunduka, kamlongela Petiri, “Uka kuchughu kwangu, Setani! Ghweghwe kwa kwatso kuna nene, kwaapfila ghamawatso ghako si gha Imlungu baye, ila gha iwanu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanafunzi wake, “Munu wowose iyobama kuniwinza, yebele imwenyegho, yetwike ghumsalaba ghwake yaniwinze. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kwa apfila imunu iyobama kuukombola ugima wake, katsowaghitsa, lekeni imunu iyatsowaghitsa ugima wake kwaajili yangu katsowona. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Apfi imunu yatsobweda choni yang'apata isi yose, lekeni kawaghitsa ugima wake? Au imunu yatsolapfa choni yaupate keli ugima wake? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kwaapfila Imwana wa Imunu katsakutsa mna utunitso wa Aba wake hamwe na wamalaika wake, kuya katsomliha chila munu kwa achila chayatendile. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, 'Hana wanu wangi iwemile ahano, ng'awatsakufa baye mbaka wamwone Imwana wa Adamu kakutsa mna ufalume wake.'”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koghaluka chihanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Malk 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Haghabitile matsuwa sita, Yesu kamsola Petiri, Yakobu, na Yohana ndughu yake Yakobu, kaghenda nawo waliyeka kuchidando kwa liidunda litali. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Bahala hambele hawo Yesu kaghaluka, ichihanga chake ching'ala ka litsuwa, na ghamagwanda ghake ghawa matselu chwee ka ghumwanga! <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Baho lola, Musa na Eliya wawalawila, wolonga naye. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Petiri kamlongela Yesu, “Ghwe Mndewa, pfinogha twetwe ukukala hanu ahano! Ung'abama, leka tutsenge pfibumbulika pfidatu, chimwe chako, chimwe cha Musa, na chimwe cha Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Hayang'ali yolonga, bingu iling'ala liwaghubika, na litsi kulawa mna libingu alila lilonga, “Ayuno Mwanangu, yanimkunda, yaninoghelighwa naye. Mtegheletseni yeye!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Na iwanafunzi hawahulike apfo, wapfuka ng'ani, watowa maghoti wenama mbaka ipfihanga pfawo pfidonza hasi. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu kawaghendela kawakinda, kawalongela, “Mwinuke, wala mleke kupfuka!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Hawenule tsinenge, ng'awonile munu baye ila Yesu yaliyeka.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Hawang'ali wohulumka mchidunda, Yesu kawalaghitsa, “Mleke kumlongela munu wowose achila chamwonile mbaka Imwana wa Imunu hayatsotsihiluka kulawa kuna iwafile.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Kuya iwanafunzi wamghutsa, “Lelo heule iwaandishi wa Ghamalaghitso wolonga Eliya kobamighwa tanu yatse?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu kawedika, kalonga, “Kweli tanu Eliya kakutsa, naye katsakwika ghoya pfinu pfose; <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />ila nomlongelani, Eliya mala katsa, nawo ng'awamtangile baye, lekeni wamtendela ghose ghawabamile. Na pfipfo Imwana wa Imunu pfawatsomdununza.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Baho iwanafunzi wamanya ka Yesu yang'ali yowalongela mbuli tsa Yohana Mbatitsi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imsongolo yana ichinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Malk 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Hawapfikile kuna ghumtingano ghwa iwanu, munu yumwe kamghendela Yesu, kamtowela maghoti, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />kalonga, “Ghwemtwatsa, umwonele libatsi imwanangu, kakufa chisala, na kodununzighwa ng'ani; kwaapfila mala nyingi kakughwa mna ghumoto, na mala nyingi mna ghamatsi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nimghala kuna iwanafunzi wako, lekeni ng'awadahile kumhonetsa baye.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu kedika, “Mwemwe mweleko ing'aghutoghola, na ighwihile! Nitsokala na mwemwe mbaka tsuwachi? Nitsomdudumilani mwemwe mbaka tsuwachi? Mngalile ahano imsongolo ayo!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu kamkembela ichinyamkela, na ichinyamkela kamlawa imsongolo ayula, imsongolo ayula kahona tangu isaa aila.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Kuya iwanafunzi wamghendela Yesu hayakalile kayeka, wamghutsa, “Heule twetwe tuhila naye ichinyamkela ayula?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu kawalongela, “Kwaapfila inoghola yenu ihunguka. Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, hata mng'awa na noghola ka imbeghu ya haladali, mwodaha kulilongela lidunda alino, ‘Ulawe ahano, ughende akula,’ nalyo lyakuka. Wala ng'akutsakuwa na chinu chochose ing'achidahika kuna mwemwe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Lekeni ichinyamkela ka ayuno ng'odaha kulawa baye kwa nzila yoyose, ila kwa ukulomba na ukufunga ukuja.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga keli imbuli ya lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Malk 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Nawo wose hawakalile Galilaya, Yesu kawalongela, “Imwana wa Adamu katsoghelighwa mna ghamoko gha iwanu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />nawo watsomkoma, na mna litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsihiluka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Iwanafunzi wasing'inika ng'ani.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuliha ikodi ya Ing'anda ya Imlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Hata hawapfikile Kaperinaumu, iwasola kodi ya lihekalu wamghendela Petiri, wamghutsa, “Apfi imlangulitsi wenu koliha inusu shekeli, ikodi ya lihekalu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Naye kawedika, “Ona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Petiri hayengile mng'anda, Yesu kalongola ukumghutsa, “Simoni, ukonatse? Wafalume wa isi wosola kodi au ushulu kwa wanu wachi? Kwa iwanawo au kwa iwahenza?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petiri kamwidika, “Kwa iwahenza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu kalonga, “Pfinogha, ka apfo iwana wawo ng'awobamighwa kuliha kodi baye. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Lekeni, ili tuleke kuwakwatsa, ghenda kuna litsimbu, wase indoano yako, umsole isomba ayula yulongola kumlowa; na ung'amwasama ghumlomo ghwake kutsakona shekeli. Isole ukaweng'e kwaajili ya ikodi yangu na yako.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Yuhi iyali mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Malk 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Mna isaa aila wanafunzi wamghendela Yesu, wamghutsa, “Munu yuhi iyali mkulu mna ufalume wa kulanga?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu kamkema mwana yumwe mdodo, kamwika haghati hawo, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />kalonga, “Nomlongelani ghendo, ka ng'amghaluka baye mghati mwenu na kwighala na iwana iwadodo, ng'amtsakwingila ghendo baye mna ufalume wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Apfo munu wowose iyehulumsa imwenyegho yawe ka imwana ayuno, ayo yuyo iyali mkulu mna ufalume wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Na munu wowose iyombokela imwana mdodo kama ayuno kwa taghwa lyangu, ayo konibokela nene.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipfinu ipfimhonza imunu yatende nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Malk 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Lekeni munu wowose iyomhonza yumwe wa iwana wadodo awano iwonitoghola nene yatende nzambi, ng'apfu yohighwe libwe likulu lya ukusaghila msingo na yasighwe mwibahali kuna ghamatsi ighaghendese.<figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">1. Iwanu weli wosaghila libwe lyo ukusaghila</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Isi yose itsoghaya kwaajili ya aghala ighowahonza iwanu waghise ukutoghola kwao! Mana agho ighohonza iwanu ghatsolawila ghendo, lekeni katsoghaya imunu ayula iyoghatenda ghalawile!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Ka ghumoko ghwako au ghumghulu ghwako ghwokuhonza utende ighehile, ughugane ughwase kutali naghwe. Ng'apfu wingile mna ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa akuno kuhungukighwa na ghumoko au ghumghulu, kubita kuwa na ghamoko meli na maghulu meli na kwasighwa mna ghumoto ghwa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Inenge yako ing'akuhonza utende ighehile, uing'ole uyase kutali naghwe! Ng'apfu wingile mna ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa aku kuna nenge imwe kubita kuwa na nenge mbili na kwasighwa mna ghumoto.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ng'olo yaghile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Mwalangitse mleke kumbetsa yumwe wa iwana wadodo awano, kwaapfila, nomlongelani wamalaika wawo ako kulanga matsuwa ghose wa hambele ha Aba wangu iyali kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kwaapfila Imwana wa Adamu katsa kuwakombola awala iwaghile.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mkonatse? Ka munu kana ng'olo mia imwe, kuya yumwe kagha, apfi ng'atsowaleka baye awala tisini na tisa mpfidunda na kughenda yakambame ayula iyaghile? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Na yang'amwona, nomlongelani kweli ghendo, katsomdeng'elela ng'ani ayo kubita awala tisini na tisa ing'awaghile. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Pfipfo, ng'apfinogha baye hambele ha Aba wenu iyali kulanga yumwe wa iwadodo awano yaghe.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumwapfila ndughu iyatendile nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Ndughu yako yang'akutendela totso, ughende ukamkanye totso lyake, ghweghwe na yeye mliyeka. Yang'akutegheletsa, kumpata ndughu yako. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Lekeni yang'alema kukutegheletsa, msole munu yumwe au weli hamwe naghwe, ili ‘kwa wakalangama weli au wadatu chila ghomba lilamlighwe,’ kama apfila Ghamaandiko ighelile pfagholonga. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Na yang'alema kuwategheletsa awo ulilongele likanisa, na kama pfipfila kalema kulitegheletsa likanisa, mleke kuna ghweghwe yawe ka imunu ing'ammanyile Imlungu na imtotsa kodi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, ghoghose ghamtsofunga muisi ghatsakuwa ghafungiighwa kulanga, na ghoghose ghamtsodohola muisi, ghatsakuwa ghadoholighwa kulanga.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Nomlongelani keli, kweli ghendo, wabili wenu wang'epatana muisi mna chinu chochose chawatsolomba, Aba wangu iyali kulanga katsowatendela ichinu acho. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kwaapfila hawali wanu weli au wadatu wetingana kwa litaghwa lyangu, nene nabaho hamwe nao.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwaleghusila ghamatotso wanu wangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Kuya Petiri kamghendela, kamghutsa, “Ghwemtwatsa, apfi ndughu yangu yanitendele matotso mala ngapi, na nene nimleghusile? Hata mala saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu kamwidika, “Sikulongela hata mala saba baye, ila hata saba mala sabini, <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />kwa ajili ayo, ufalume wa kulanga weghala na mfalume yumwe iyabamile kukaghula tsisendi tsake kuna iwatumwa wake. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Hayanduse ukupeta, wamghalila imunu yumwe iyang'ali yomdai talanta elufu kumi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Naye hayakalile kahela chinu cha ukuliha, imtwatsa kalaghitsa yautsighwe, yeye, imwehe wake, na iwanaghe, na pfose pfayalinapfo, ili yalihe lideni alila. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Baho imtumwa ayula kamwinamila hasi hambele hake, kalonga, ‘Unidudumile, na nene nitsokuliha chila chinu.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Imtwatsa kamwonela libatsi imtumwa ayula, kamlekelela, kamleghusila lideni alila.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Lekeni imtumwa ayula koka, kuya kamwona mtumwa miyaghe iyang'ali yomdai dinari miya imwe, kamghogha kamkwida ilumelo, kamlongela, ‘Unilihe sendi tsangu!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Imtumwa miyaghe keghwisa hasi hambele hake, kamlomba, kalonga, ‘Unidudumile, nitsokuliha tsose.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Lekeni yeye kalema, kaghenda kumwasa mchifungo, mbaka hayatsoliha lideni alila. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Iwatumwa wangi hawonile achila ichilawile, wasing'inika ng'ani, waghenda kumlongela imndewa wao chila chinu ichilawile. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Baho imndewa wake kamkema, kamlongela, ‘Ghweghwe mtumwa wihile, nikuleghusila lideni alila lyose, haunidedetse, <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />hebai ghweghwe ng'umwonele baye libatsi imtumwa miyagho kama nene pfanikwonele libatsi ghweghwe?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Apfo imndewa wake kona maya ng'ani, kamghela mchifungo, yadununzighwe mbaka hayatsoliha lideni lyose liyodaighwa.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />“Apfi pfifo Aba wangu iyali kulanga pfayatsomtendelani mwemwe, ana ng'amuwaleghusila wandughu tsenu ghamatotso ghawo kulawa mna imimoyo yenu.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Ukwileka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Malk 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu hayamalitse ukulonga ghamalangulitso agho, kalawa kuna isi ya Galilaya kaghenda kuna isi ya Yudeya, kumwambu kwa ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Kingili kulu lya wanu limkoleletsa, naye kuko kawahonetsa.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Na Mafarisayo wamghendela Yesu wamghetse, wamghutsa, “Pfihi pfinogha imlume kumleka mwehe wake kwa mbuli yoyose?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Naye Yesu kawedika, kalonga, “Pfihi ng'amsomile baye pfayandikighwe mna Ghamaandiko ighelile, ka yeye iyawaumbile aho mwanduso tsakawaumba munu mmale na munu pinga, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />na kalonga, ‘apfo, immale katsomleka aba wake na mai wake, katselunga na imwehe wake, nawo weli watsakuwa lukuli lumwe?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Apfo ng'awatsakuwa weli keli baye, ila lukuli lumwe. Apfo chiyalumbile Imlungu, imunu yaleke kuchighola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Wamghutsa, “Hebali lelo Musa tsayalaghitse immale yamwing'e mwehe wake hati ya talaka yamleke?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Kawedika, “Musa kamwing'eni luhusa muwaleke wehe wenu kwaapfila imimoyo yenu mikomu, lekeni ng'aiwile apfo kulawa mwanduso baye. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Lekeni nomlongelani mwemwe, munu wowose iyomleka imwehe wake kwa ghomba ing'alili lya ughoni, na kukwela pinga yungi, ayo kotenda nzambi ya ughoni.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Wanafunzi wake wamlongela, “Ka apfo pfipfo pfaili kwa imlume na mwehe wake, ng'apfu kuleka kukwelela.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu kawedika, “Si wanu wose baye iwodaha kulibokela lilonga alino, ila awala waliyeka iweng'ighwe na Imlungu. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kwaapfila kuna wanu tangu pfawelekighwe si wa kukwela baye, na wamwenga wasweyulighwa na iwanu waleke ukukwela, lekeni wamwenga wesweyula iwenyegho kwaajili ya ufalume wa kulanga. Iyodaha kulibokela lilonga alino, leka yalibokele.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowabaliki iwana wadowado</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Malk 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Kuya wanu wangi wamghalila Yesu iwana wadowado yawekile ghamoko yawalombele, lekeni wanafunzi wake wawakembela iwanu awo. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Lekeni Yesu kalonga, “Walekeni iwana wadowado watse kuna nene, mleke kuwaghoma, kwaapfila ufalume wa kulanga wa iwanu iwali kama iwana awano.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Kawekila ghamoko, kuya koka hanu aho.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbwanga tajiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Malk 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Munu yumwe kamghendela Yesu kamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, angu nene nitende chinu chachi ichinoghile ili niubokele ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu kamwidika, “Hebali unighutsa imbuli ya ichinu ichinoghile? Hana mnu yumwe yaliyeka iyanoghile. Lekeni ung'abama kwingila mna ugima, ghakinde ghamalaghitso.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Imunu ayula kamghutsa, “Ghamalaghitso ghahi?” Yesu kamwidika, “Aghano, uleke kukoma, uleke kutenda ughoni, uleke kwiba, na uleke kulapfa ukalangama wa ughutsu, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />uwaheshimu baba wako na mamo wako, umkunde miyagho kama pfawikunda ghumwenyegho.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Imbwanga ayula kamlongela, “Aghano ghose nighakinda, nihungukighwe na choni lelo?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ung'abama kuwa munu yatimilike, ughende ukautse ipfinu pfako pfose pfauli napfo, uweng'e tsisendi iwahingwa, naghwe kutsakuwa na hatsina kulanga, kuya utse uniwinze.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Imbwanga ayula hayahulike apfo, koka kwa hutsuni, kwaapfila tsakana mali nyingi.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanafunzi wake, “Nomlongelani ukweli ghendo, itsakuwa pfikomu kwa tajiri kwingila mna ufalume wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Nomlongelani keli, yapfibewe kwa ingamiya kwingila mna lilanga lya ishindano, kubita imunu tajiri ukwingila mna ufalume wa Imlungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Wanafunzi hawahulike apfo, wakangawala ghendo, wamghutsa, “Lelo yuhi iyodaha ukukombolighwa?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu kawatsodolela tsinenge, kuya kawalongela, “Kwa imwanadamu ichinu achino ng'achidahika baye, lekeni kwa Imlungu ghose ghodahika.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Baho, Petiri kalonga, “Lola, twetwe tuleka pfinu pfose tukuwinza ghweghwe, lelo tutsopata choni?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nomlongelani kweli ghendo, mna ulimwengu ukutsa, Imwana wa Adamu hayatsokala mna ichighoda cha utunitso wake, mwemwe imniwinzile nene pfipfila mtsokala mna pfighoda kumi na pfili, kughatawala makabila kumi na meli gha Isiraeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na imunu wowose iyalekile tsing'anda, au kaka tsake, au lumbu tsake, au aba wake, au mai wake, au iwanaghe, au imighunda yake kwaajili yangu, ayo katsobokela mala kumi, na katsohala ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Lekeni awala wa mwanduso watsakuwa wa utsighilo, na wautsighilo watsakuwa wamwanduso.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Iwosang'ana mne mghunda ghwa mitsabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Undewa we Imulungu weghala ne imunu yane mghunda, iyalawile lupfilipfili kaghenda kubama iwanu wakasang'ane mne mghunda ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Katoghola kuwaliha sendi tsa litsuwa limwe, kuya kawaghala mne mghunda ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Masaa madatu hambele koka keli, kawona iwanu wangi wema mne ghulilo wahela sang'ano. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Kawalongela, ‘Mwemwe mwose mghende mne mghunda ghwangu mkasang'ane, nitsowaliha pfinoghile.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Nawo waghenda. Kuya kaghenda keli saa sita na saa tisa, katenda pfipfila. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Haipfikile saa kumi na imwe koka keli, kawona iwanu wangi wema hane ghulilo, kawaghutsa, ‘Ebali mwimile hano misi yose bila sang'ano?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Iwanu awo wamwidika, ‘Kwaapfila haduhu imunu iyatwing'ile sang'ano.’ Kawalongela, ‘Namwe pfipfila mghende mkasang'ane mne mghunda ghwangu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Nemihe haipfikile, imunu yane mghunda kamlongela mwimilitsi wake, ‘Uwakeme iwanu iwasang'ane, uwalihe sendi tsawo, wanduse na wautsighilo kuya awala iwalongole.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Iwanu iwasang'ane kwandusila saa kumi na imwe hawatsile, chila munu kabokela malilho gha litsuwa limwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Apfo awala iwalongole kusang'ana hawatsile, tsawalolela kubokela sendi nyingi, lekeni chila munu kabokela dinali imwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Hawabokele maliho ghawo, wandusa kumsing'inikila ayula yane mghunda. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Walonga, ‘Iwanu wano iwatsile kusang'ana nemihe, wasang'ana kwa saa limwe liliheka, lekeni kuwaliha ka pfautulihe twetwe itusang'ane misi yose mlutsua.’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Naye kamwidika yumwe wawo, ‘Sale yangu, sikubunzile bae. Apfi ghweghwe ng'utoghole kusang'ana kwa malilho gha litsuwa limwe? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Lelo usole ichili chako uke. Nene nobama kumwing'a ayula wa utsighilo ka pfanikwing'ile ghweghwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Angu ng'apfinoghile bae nene kutenda achila chanibama kwa sendi tsangu mwenyegho? Au kwakona chepfu kwaapfila nene namluso?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Kuya Yesu kamalitsa kwa ukulonga, “Apfo, wa utsighilo katsakuwa wa mwanduso, na ayula wamwanduso katsakuwa wautsighilo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga lwakadatu imbuli ya lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Malk 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu hayang'ali yoghenda Yerusalemu kawasola iwanang'ina kumi na weli waliyeka, kawalongela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Mlole, twogheluka Yerusalemu, ako Imwana we Imunu katsakwing'ighwa mne ghamoko ghe iwatambika wakulu ne iwalangulitsi we ghamalaghitso. Nawo watsomhigha yakomighwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Kuya watsomghala kwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi, nawo watsombetsa, watsomtsipula na watsomkoma kwa kumuwamba mna msalaba, lekeni ghamatsuwa madatu hambele katsotsilihuka!”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mai wawo Jakobu na Yohane kowalombela ukulu iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Malk 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Kuya mai we iwana wa Sebedayo kamghendela Yesu hamwe ne iwanaghe, katowa ghamaghoti, kamlomba amtendele choyobama.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Ubama choni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Chondechonde, ulaghitse wanangu wano weli wakale ubali wako wa kujilo na wa kumoso mne undewa wako.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ng'ammanyile bae achila chamlomba. Angu mwodaha kunwela ichikombe chanitsonwela nene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Wamwidika, “Twodaha.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mtsonwela ghendo ichikombe changu, lekeni kukala kumoso au kukala kujilo, si sang'ano yangu bae. Lekeni chinu acho watsakwing'ighwa awala iwasaghulighwe na Aba wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Iwanang'ina kumi hawahulike apfo, tsawawonela maya awala wandughu weli.<verse eid="MAT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Lekeni Yesu kawakema, kawalongela, “Mwomanya ka iwabala we iwanu iwali si Wayahudi wowalongotsa iwanu wawo kwa ingupfu, na pfilongotsi wawo wana ukulu kuna wawo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Lekeni ileke kuwa apfo kuna mwemwe, ila imunu wowose iyobama kuwa imkulu mghati mwenu, yawe mtumwa wenu, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />na imunu wowose iyobama kuwa wa mwanduso kobamighwa yawe mtumwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Pfipfo ka Imwana we Imunu, ng'atsile bae kutumikighwa, ila kutumikila na kulapfa ughima wake kuwakombola iwanu wengi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa pfifita weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Malk 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hawang'ali wakuka Yeriko, iwanu wengi tsawamuwinza. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Pfifita weli iwang'ali wokala mmbalimbali mwe inzila hawahulike Yesu kobita, wandusa kukemelela, “Imtwatsa, Mwana wa Daudi, utwonele libatsi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Iwanu wawakembela wawalongela wanyamale, lekeni waghendelela kukemelela, “Imtwatsa, Mwana wa Daudi utwonele libatsi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu kema, kawakema kawaghutsa, “Mwobama niwatendele choni?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Wamwidika, “Imtwatsa, twobama twone!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu kawonela libatsi, katsikinda nenge tsawo, bahala wadaha ukwona, nawo wamuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwingila Yerusalemu kwa indeng'elo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hawang'ali habehi na Yerusalemu na kupfika Betifage mne Chidunda cha Mitseituni, kawatuma iwanang'ina wake weli, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />kawalongela, “Mghende mbaka mne kaye ili hambele henu, baho mtsomwona ipunda kohighwa hamwe ne imwanaghe, muwadohole mngalile hano. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Imunu wowose ang'awalongela chochose, mumlongele, ‘Imtwatsa kowabama,’ naye katsowaleka mke.” <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Achino chilawila ili aghala ighalongighwe na manabii ghatimile. <verse eid="MAT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Umlongele neghe Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Lola, Mndewa wako kokutsila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Kahola na kadina ipunda, imwanapunda, imwana we ipunda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Apfo iwanang'ina waghenda watenda ka Yesu pfayawalongele. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Wamghala ipunda ne imwana we ipunda, weka ghamaghwanda ghawo mchanya mwe punda awo, na Yesu kakala mchanya mwake. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Iwanu wengi wagheka ghamaghwanda ghawo mnzila na wangi waghana milala wanzasa mnzila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Na iwanu iwamlongole na awala iwamuwinzile wose wandusa kukemelela, walonga, “Yatogholighwe, Imwana wa Daudi! Imulungu kambaliki ayula iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa! Yatogholighwe Imulungu yali kuchanya kulanga!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu hayengile Yerusalemu, iwanu wose wakangawala, weghutsa, “Ayu nani?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Iwanu wawedika, “Ayuno nabii, Yesu wa Natsareti ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mne ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Malk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu kengila mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu kawawinga wose awala iwang'ali woghula na iwang'ali wohutsa. Katsibindula tsimetsa tsawo tsa ukubenela tsisendi na ipfighoda pfa awala iwang'ali woutsa iwanjiwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Kawalongela, “Yandikighwa, ‘Ing'anda yangu itsokemighwa ing'anda ya ukulombela.’ Lekeni mwemwe mwoitenda iwe mango ye iwabapfi!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ipfifita na ipfimbete wamghendela Yesu mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, naye kawahonetsa. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Lekeni iwatambika wakulu na iwolangulitsa ghamalaghitso tsawona maya hawonile pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayatendile Yesu, ne iwana pfawakemelele mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, “Yatogholighwe Imwana wa Daudi!” <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Apfo wamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi kohulika chawolonga iwana wano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Kawedika, “Ona, ng'amsomile bae? ‘Kwa milomo ye iwana wadowado ne iwana iwakong'a kwotogholighwa ghendo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Yesu kawaleka kaghenda Betaniya, kunze kwe ghumji, kawasa kuko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koulighita mbiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Malk 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Nemitondo lupfilipfili, Yesu hayang'ali kakuya mne ghumji, tsakona inzala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Kaghwona mbiki mmbalimbali mwe inzila, kaghughendela lekeni ng'onile chochose bae ila imitsani iliyeka. Apfo kaghulongela, “Uleke ukweleka keli ghamatunda!” Bahala mbiki ghula ghunyala.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Iwanang'ina wake hawonile apfo wakangawala, wamghutsa, “Ule mbiki ghuno ghusumka kunyala?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongelani ghendo mng'atoghola na kuleka kwalangula, mwodaha kutenda si achila chiliyeka ichanendile mne mbiki, ila mwodaha kuchilongela chidunda chino, ‘Wibule, wikeyase mwibahali,’ kuya itsakuwa pfipfo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Mng'atoghola, chochose chamlomba mtsobokela.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yesu woghutsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Malk 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu kengila mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, na hayang'ali yolangulitsa, iwatambika wakulu na iwakulu we iwanu wamghendela, wamghutsa, “Kwa ukulu wachi kotenda ghano ghose? Yuhi yakwing'ile ukulu uno?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu kawedika, “Na nene nitsowaghutsa imbuli imwe, mng'anyidika, nitsowalongela notenda ghano kwa ukulu wachi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Apfi ubatitso wa Yohane ulawile kwani? Tsaulawa kulanga au kwe iwanu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Wandusa kwighutsa iwenyegho kwe iwenyegho walonga, “Tung'alonga, ‘Ulawa kulanga,’ katsotughutsa, ‘Ule lelo ng'amumtoghole Yohane?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Lekeni tung'alonga, ‘Ulawa kwe iwanu,’ twopfuka iwanu, kwaapfila wose tsawatoghola Yohane kakala nabii.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Apfo wamwidika Yesu, “Ng'atumanyile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Naye kawedika, “Na nene siwalongela bae kwa ukulu wachi notenda ipfinu apfi.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye iwana weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Mkonatse? Imunu yumwe tsakana iwana weli, kaghenda kwa ayula mwana mkulu kamlongela, ‘Mwanangu, leloli ughende ukasang'ane mne mghunda.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Naye kamwidika, ‘Sighenda bae,’ lekeni hambele chidogho kaghaluka kaghenda. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Kuya aba ayo kamghendela imwana wa keli, kamlongela ichinu chichila. Naye kamwidika, ‘Ona aba,’ lekeni ng'aghendile bae. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Lelo yuhi mna iwana wano weli iyatendile achila chayabamile aba wake?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Wamwidika, “Imwana imkulu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongelani ghendo, iwasola kodi na iwaghoni watsowalongola kwingila mne undewa we Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Kwaapfila Yohane tsakatsa kuwalangusa inzila inoghile, namwe ng'amumtoghole bae, lekeni iwasola kodi na iwaghoni wamtoghola. Namwe hata hamwonile apfo, ng'amghaluke bae na kumtoghola.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mghunda ghwa mitsabibu ne iwanu iwolima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Malk 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu kalonga, “Mtegheletse imbuli ingi, imunu yumwe yane ing'anda kahanda tsabibu mne mghunda. Kaghuteghela luwa mghunda agho, kahimba lipondo lya ukukamila tsabibu, katsenga ghumnala, kawakodishila iwanu iwolima, kuya koka ghumwanza. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Ghamatsuwa gha ukupfuna haghapfikile, kawatuma iwatumwa wake wakasole tsabibu. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Hawala iwanu iwolima wawaghogha iwatumwa wake, yumwe wamtowa, yungi wamkoma, na yungi wamtowa na ghamabwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Kuya tsakawatuma keli watumwa wangi, tsawengi kubita awala wamwanduso, na iwanu wala iwolima wawatendela pfipfila. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Hawamalile wose ghendo, kamtuma imwanaghe kuna wawo, kalonga, ‘Watsomtegheletsa mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Lekeni iwanu iwolima hawamwonile, welongela iwenyegho, ‘Ayuno iye muhala, mtse tumkome tusole uhala wake!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Apfo wamghogha, wamwasa kunze kwe mghunda ghwe imitsabibu, wamkoma.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Lelo, imunu yane mghunda hayatsakutsa, yatsowatenda choni awala iwanu iwolima?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Wamwidika, “Katsowakoma ghendo iwanu awo wehile, katsoweka iwanu wangi mne mghunda aghwo, nawo watsomgholela tsitsabibu mne ghamatsuwa ghe kupfuna.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ng'amsomile bae Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Libwe ililemighwe na iwatsengagha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">liwa libwe kulu lye lukwalambatsa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Imbuli ino ilawa kwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nayo yotukangawatsa.’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Apfo nowalongelani ghendo, undewa we Imulungu utsobokighwa kuna mwemwe na kwing'ighwa iwanu iwakweleka ghamatunda ghake, awala iwotenda aghala ghobama Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Na ayula iyakughwa mchanya mwe libwe lino katsobeneka beneka, na wowose ilitsomghwila litsomhonda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Watambika wakulu na Mafarisayo hawahulike apfo, tsawamanya Yesu tsaang'ali yowalonga wawo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Apfo wabama inzila ya kumghoghela, lekeni wapfuka iwanu, kwaapfila iwanu tsawamona Yesu tsakakala nabii.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya ichihungo cha ukukwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu kawalongela keli iwanu kwa imbuli. <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Undewa we Imulungu weghala ne Imndewa iyamtendele mwanaghe chihungo cha ukukwela. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Kawatuma iwatumwa wake wawalongele awala iwakemighwe watse kune chihungo, lekeni walema ukutsa. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Kuya kawatuma iwatumwa wangi, kalonga, ‘Muwalongele pfino awala iwakemighwe kune chihungo, nyambika ipfijo. Wang'ombe wangu iwanenehe wachinjighwa, na chila chinu chaghoya. Mtse kuchihungo.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Lekeni iwanu awo ng'awalangitse bae, woka, yumwe kune mghunda wake na yungi kune sang'ano tsake. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Nawo iwanu iwakalile wawaghogha iwatumwa wake, wawatendela pfihile na wawakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Imndewa ayo tsakona maya. Apfo kawatuma asikali wake wawakome awala iwawakomile iwatumwa wake, na wailakatsa isi yawo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Kuya kawakema iwatumwa wake kawalongela, chihungo cha ukukwela ma cha tiyali, lekeni awala iwakemighwe watse kune ichihungo ng'awatsile bae. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Apfo, mghende kunzila, ako wowose wamuwona muwakeme watse kune ichihungo. <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Iwatumwa wala woka, waghenda mne tsinzila wawaghala wanu wose yawawonile, iwehile na iwanoghile, na chihungo tsachimema iwahenza.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Imndewa hayengile mng'anda kuwalolesa iwahenza wake, kamwona imunu yumwe, ng'apfalile bae lighwanda lye ichihungo. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Kamghutsa, ‘Sale yangu, angu wingiletse hano naghwe kwahela lighwanda lye ichihungo?’ Lekeni imunu ayo ng'alongile chinu bae. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Kuya imndewa kawalongela iwatumwa, ‘Mmwowe ghamoko na ghamaghulu mmwase kunze kune chisi. Ako kutsakuwa ne ichililo ne ukughegheda ghamatsino.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Kuya Yesu kalonga, “Kwaapfila iwakemighwe wengi, lekeni iwasaghulighwe wadodo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuliha kodi kwa Kaisari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Malk 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Apfo Mafarisayo woka na wabama inzila ye ukumtegha Yesu kwa mbuli tsake. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Kuya wawatuma iwanang'ina wawo hamwe ne iwanu wangi wa kingili lya Herodi. Walonga, “Mlangulitsi, twomanya ghendo ghweghwe kolongesa. Naghwe koilangulitsa pfinoghile inzila ye Imulungu, ng'upfuka bae ukulu we imunu wowose, kwaapfila ng'ulola bae ipfihanga pfe iwanu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Utulongele lelo, ukonatse? Apfi pfinogha kuliha kodi kwa Kaisari, au ng'apfinoghile bae.”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Lekeni Yesu tsakamanya ukwiha kwawo, apfo kawalongela, “Mwawang'enye, ule mwobama kunitegha? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Nanguseni sendi yamlihila kodi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Wamghalila isendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Naye kawaghutsa, “Angu chihanga na taghwa lino pfa nani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Wamwidika, “Pfa Kaisari mndewa wa Roma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Apfo Yesu kawalongela, “Lelo, mwing'eni Kaisari aghala gha Kaisari na mwing'eni Imulungu aghala ghe Imulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Hawahulike apfo, wakangawala, apfo wamleka, woka tsawo.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukukwela ne ukutsilihuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Malk 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Litsuwa lilyo, Masadukayo wamwenga, iwanu iwolonga kuduhu kutsilihuka, wamghendela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Wamghutsa walonga, “Mlangulitsi, Musa katulongela immale ang'afa bila kweleka iwana, ndughu yake kobamighwa amkwele chitsuka ayo, ili amwelekele indughu yake iwana. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Lelo, hakaye hetu hano tsahana iwandughu saba. Wamwanduso kakwela, kuya kafa, na kwaapfila tsakahela iwana, mwehe wake kamlekela ndughu yake. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Chinu chichila chimlawila ndughu yake wa keli, wa kadatu, mbaka ndughu yake wa saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Kuya mwehe ayo naye kafa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Lelo iwanu hawotsotsilihuka mne litsuwa lya kutsilihuka, mwehe ayo katsokuwa wa yuhi mna iwandughu wano saba? Kwaapfila wose tsawamkwela.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu kawedika, “Mwakwagha, kwaapfila ng'amanyile bae Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka au ngupfu ye Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kwaapfila iwanu hawatsotsilihuka, kuduhu ukukwela wala ukukwelighwa, watsokuwa ka malaika iwali kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Lekeni, imbuli yo ukutsilihuka kwe iwanu, ng'amsomile bae achila chayamlongeleni Imulungu? Kawalongela, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Nene na Imulungu wa Abrahamu, na Imulungu wa Isaka, na Imulungu wa Yakobu.’ Yeye si Imulungu wa iwanu iwafile bae, ila Imulungu we iwanu waghima.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Iwanu hawahulike apfi, wakangawala kwa ghamalangulitso ghake.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Malk 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafarisayo hawahulike ka Yesu kawatenda Masadukayo wenyamale, wetingana hamwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />yumwe wawo, imlangulitsi we Ghamalaghitso, kamghutsa Yesu kwa kumtegha. <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />Kamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, ihi indaghitso ng'ulu kubita tsose mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu kedika, “ ‘Mnoghele Imtwatsa Imulungu wako kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghose, kwa muhe wako wose, na kwa tsimbutsi tsako tsose.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Aino iyo indaghitso ng'ulu na ya mwanduso. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Na ya keli ighala na ino, umnoghele miyagho ka pfawinoghela imwenyegho. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ghamalaghitso ghose gha Musa na ghamalangulitso ghe manabii ghohuwila Ghamalaghitso ghano meli.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristu ka Imwana wa nani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Malk 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Mafarisayo hawetingane hamwe, Yesu kawaghutsa, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Mwemwe mmwonatse Kiristu. Angu imwana wa nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Wamwidika, “Imwana wa Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu kawaghutsa, “Ule lelo Daudi kwa kulongotsighwa na ghumuhe kamkema ‘Imtwatsa?’ Kwaapfila tsakalonga,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Imtwatsa kamlongela Imtwatsa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">ukale hano hane ghumoko ghwangu ghwa kujilo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mbaka niweke iwokuhila hasi he ghamaghulu ghako.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Ka Daudi komkema, ‘Imtwatsa,’ lelo ikuwatse awe imwanaghe?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Kuduhu imunu yamwidike, na kulawa litsuwa alyo na kughendela kuduhu imunu yadahile kumghutsa Yesu imbuli yoyose.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Mtsoghaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Malk 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">Luk 20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanu na iwanang'ina wake. <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo wana ukulu wa kulangulitsa Malaghitso gha Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Apfo mghakinde na mtende aghala ghose ghawowalongela, lekeni mleke kutenda aghala ghawotenda wawo, kwaapfila ng'awotenda bae aghala ghawolonga. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Wakowa imitsigho mitito na kuwatwika iwanu mmahegha mwawo. Lekeni wawo iwenyegho ng'awobama bae hata kugholosa chidole na kuinula. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Ghose ghawotenda, wotenda ili iwanu wawone, kwaapfila wopfala ipfinu ipfandikighwe Ghamalaghitso mne pfihanga pfawo na mne ghamoko ghawo, na wakongetsa utali we ghamaghwanda ghawo. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Wonoghela kukala hanu hanoghile mne chihungo na kukala mne pfighoda ipfili hambele mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Wonoghela kulamsighwa mmasoko na kukemighwa ne iwanu, ‘Mlangulitsi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Lekeni mwemwe mleke kukemighwa ‘Mlangulitsi,’ kwaapfila mna Mlangulitsi yumwe yaliyeka, na mwemwe mwose mwawandughu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Wala mleke kumkema imunu ‘aba’ hano muisi, kwaapfila mna ‘Aba’ yumwe yaliyeka, naye ka kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Na mleke kukemighwa ‘Ipfilongotsi’ kwaapfila mna ichilongotsi yumwe yaliyeka, naye Kiristu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Na imkulu mghati mwenu kobamighwa yawe mtumwa wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Na imunu wowose yetenda mkulu, katsotendighwa mdodo, na wowose yetenda mdodo, katsotendighwa mkulu.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koulighita ung'enye wawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Malk 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luk 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">Luk 20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Mtsoghaya mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo! Mwawang'enye! Kwaapfila mowahindila iwanu libani lya undewa wa kulanga, na mwemwe iwenyegho ng'amkwingila bae, wala ng'amuwalekelela awala iwobama kwingila. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Mtsoghaya mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo! Mwawang'enye! Mwemwe mwakuja mne tsing'anda tse pfitsuka na kwa ung'enye hamlomba mwolonga mbuli nyingi! Apfo mtsohighighwa ng'ani!<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Mtsoghaya, yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo! Mwawang'enye mwemwe! Mwoloka ibahali na mwakwanga mne isi yose kumtenda imunu yumwe iyaiwinze dini yenu, na ang'aghaluka, mwomtenda yawe na uwetso mala mbili wa ukwingila Jehanamu kubita mwemwe wenyegho<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Mtsoghaya mwemwe pfilongotsi pfifita. Mwolonga, ‘Imunu ang'elaha kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu si chinu bae, ila ang'elaha kwe inzahabu ye ing'anda ye Imulungu keyowa.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mwemwe mwawabotsi na pfifita! Chihi ichinoghile, inzahabu au ing'anda ye Imulungu iitenda inzahabu ideghete? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Pfipfila mwolonga, imunu ang'elaha kwa hanu hakutambikila si chinu bae, ila ang'elaha kwa nambiko iili hanu ha kutambikila, ayo keyowa. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Mwapfifita mwemwe! Chini chikulu nambiko au hanu ha kutambikila hakutenda nambiko ideghete? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Apfo ayula yelaha kwa hanu ha kutambikila, kelaha kwa chila chinu ichili mchanya mwake, <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />na ayula yelaha kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu, kelaha kwe ing'anda ayo, na kwa Imulungu iyokala mghati mwake. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Na ayula yelaha kwa kulanga kelaha kwa chighoda che undewa che Imulungu na kwa Imulungu iyochikalila.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Mtsoghaya mwemwe imlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso, na Mafarisayo! Wang'enye! Kwaapfila mwolapfa tsaka ya pfinu pfidodo ka imitsani iinung'ila ghoya, binzali na kalafuu, lekeni mwoleka kutsikinda mbuli ng'ulu tsa Ghamalaghitso ka pfila haki, libatsi ne ukutoghola. Mghatende agha, na mleke kughaleka aghala ghangi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Pfilongotsi pfifita! Mwolapfa ng'onzi mne ghamatsi, lekeni mwometsa ingamiya!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Mtsoghaya, mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo! Mwawang'enye, mwohopfugha chikombe na chiha kwa kunze, lekeni mwoleka mghati mmema ipfinu pfampatile kwa kuboka na ubwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Ghwe Mfarisayo chipfita! Tanu wopfughe mghati mwe ichikombe ne ichiha, kuya kunze kutsodegheta.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Mtsoghaya, mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo, mwawang'enye, mwighala ne tsikabuli itsibakigwe ichokaa, kunze tsakwoneka tsinogha, lekeni mghati tsimema imipate ye iwanu iwafile na chila chinu chihile. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Namwe pfipfila, kunze mwakoneka kwe iwanu ka mnogha lekeni mghati mwenu, mmema ung'enye na ghehile.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga Mafarisayo watsohighighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luk 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Mtsoghaya, mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso, na Mafarisayo, mwawang'enye! Mowatsengela tsikabuli manabii na kutsighela unzolingo tsikabuli tse iwanu iwanoghile. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Namwe mwolonga, ‘Tung'akalile mne ghamatsuwa gha iwabala wetu, tung'alekile kwilunga nawo kuwakoma manabii!’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Apfo mwelangusa iwenyegho ka mwa watsukulu wa awala yawawakomile manabii, <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />lelo mghendeletse achila chawatendile iwabala wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />“Mwemwe iwanzoka na iwana we iwanzoka! Mtsohepatse ukuhighighwa Jehanamu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Apfo nowaghalilani manabii, ne iwanu wane nzewele, na iwalangulitsi. Wangi wawo mtsowakoma na wangi mtsowawamba mna misalaba, wangi mtsowatowa pfiboko mne tsing'anda tsenu tse ukulombela na kuwawinga kulawa ghumji ghuno kughenda ghumji ghungi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Na idamu ye iwanu iwanoghile ikwitike muisi itsodaighwa kuna mwemwe, kulawa idamu ya Abeli ayula yanoghile, mbaka idamu ya Sakariya imwana wa Balakiya yamumkomile haghati he ing'anda ye Imulungu na hanu he ukulapfila inambiko. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nowalongelani ghendo, mweleko ghuno ghutsohighighwa kwaajili ya agho.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowanoghela iwanu wa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Ghwe Yerusalemu, Yerusalemu! Ghweghwe yuwakomile manabii na kuwatowa ghamabwe awala iwatumighwe kuna ghweghwe, mala nyingi tsambama kuweka hamwe iwana wako, ka ing'uku pfowafunamila pfitsiya wake kwa ghamabawa ghake, lekeni ghweghwe, ng'aubamile bae. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Mlole, ing'anda yenu ye Imulungu ilekighwa uchuwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Kwaapfila nowalongelani, ng'amtsombona keli bae mbaka mlonge, ‘Kabalikighwa ayula iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kuhinyika kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Malk 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu kalawa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, na hayang'ali yakuka, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamlanguse matsengo ghe ing'anda ye Imulungu, <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu kawaghutsa, “Angu mwoghona agha ghose? Nowalongelani ghendo, kuduhu libwe ilitsolekighwa mchanya mwa liyaghe, chila libwe litsokwasighwa hasi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kughaya na kughanzika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Malk 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu hayang'ali kakala mne Chidunda cha Mitseituni, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela waliyeka wamghutsa, “Utulongele, agha ghose ghatsolawila tsuwachi? Na chihi chitsakuwa chitango cha ukutsa kwako na ukumala kwe iisi?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu kawedika, “Mwalangitse, imunu yaleke kuwaghutsukila. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kwaapfila iwanu wengi watsakutsa kwa taghwa lyangu na ukulonga wawo iwo Kiristu Imkombotsi, na watsowaghutsukila iwanu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Mtsohulika tsing'ondo na mbuli tsake, lekeni mleke kupfuka. Agho ghose ghobamighwa ghalawile, lekeni ukumala kwe iisi ng'ana kupfike bae. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Isi ingi itsetowa na isi ingi, undewa ungi witsetowa na undewa ungi. Kutsolawila inzala ng'ulu na mdedemo we isi chila hanu. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Agha ghose ka mwanduso wa usungu wa ukweleka imwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Kuya mtsoghoghighwa na kudunuzighwa na kukomighwa. Na isi tsose tsitsowahila kwaajili ya nene. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ghamatsuwa agho iwanu wengi watsoleka ukutoghola kwawo, na watsehunduka na wetsehila, <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />na manabii wengi wa ughutsu watsolawila na kuwaghutsukila iwanu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kwaajili ye ukongetseka ghehile, unoghelo we iwanu utsohunguka, <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />lekeni ayula iyodudumila mbaka utsighilo katsokombolighwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Na Imbuli ino Inoghile ya undewa itsopetighwa mne isi yose ka ukalangama kwe isi tsose, kuya ukumala kwe iisi kutsakutsa.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghayo kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Malk 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Mtsakona, ‘lideso lya ukuhinya’ lyalongile nabii Danyeli, litsakwima hanu haenzeluke, ayula iyosoma amanye. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Kuya iwanu iwali mne isi ya Yudeya watsumile mpfidunda. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Na iyali mchiswili mwe ing'anda yake, aleke kuhulumka kusola chinu chochose. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Yali kumghunda aleke kuya kusola lighwanda lyake. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Watsoghaya iwapinga wane tsiinda na awala iwakong'etsa mne ghamatsuwa agho. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Mlombe ili kutsuma kwenu kuleke kuwa mne msimu wa chipfeghetsi au mne litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kwaapfila kutsolawila maghayo ng'ana ghalawile bae kulawa isi hailumbighwe mbaka leloli, na ng'aghatsolawila keli bae. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ka ghamatsuwa agho ng'aghahungusighwe bae kuduhu imunu yang'akomboke. Lekeni kwaajili ye iwanu wala iwasaghulighwe, ghamatsuwa agho ghatsohungutsighwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Imunu ang'awalongela, ‘Ulole, Kiristu Imkombotsi kahano!’ Au ‘Kahala,’ mleke kutoghola. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kwaapfila tsina Kiristu wa ughutsu na manabii wa ughutsu watsolawila na kutenda pfitango pfingi na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa ili kuwaghutsukila iwanu, ka yodahika hata awala iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Muhulikitse! Nongola kuwalongelani imbuli ino ng'ana chipindi chipfike.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Apfo, Imunu wowose ang'akulongela, ‘Ulole, kakunyika,’ mleke kughenda, au ‘Kahano, mne chiheleto cha mghati,’ mleke kutoghola. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu katsakutsa ka lumwesa pfalumwemwesa mlanga mwose, kulawa ubali wa kwalilawila litsua mbaka ubali wa kwalikuswela litsua. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Hohose hane mtsogha, pfimanga watsetingana.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsa kwe Imwana we Imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Malk 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Bahala ghamatsuwa agho gha ghamaghayo aghatsomala, litsua litsoghumighwa ichisi, na lwetsi ng'alutsolapfa bae ghumwanga, tsinondo tsisolaghala kulawa mlanga na tsingupfu itsili kulanga tsitsohighisighwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Chipindi acho, chitango che Imwana we Imunu chitsolawila mlanga na isi tsose tsitsolila, iwanu watsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakutsa mna ghamawingu mlanga, hamwe ne ingupfu na utunitso mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Naye katsowatuma wamalaika wake wane malati ilikemela sideke, nawo watsoweka hamwe awala iwasaghulighwe kulawa chila ubali we iisi, kulawa utsighilo uno we lilanga mbaka utsighilo ungi.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Malk 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Mwilangulitse imbuli ino kulawa mne mbiki ghwa mkuyu, ghamaputila ghake haghakuwa madeke na kwandusa kutsuka, mwomanya mvula tsahabehi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Pfipfila, hamkona agha ghose mmanye chipindi cha habehi ghendo. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nowalongelani ghendo, iwanu wa mweleko ghuno ng'awatsoluta bae mbaka agha ghose ghalawile, <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />lilanga ne isi pfitsoluta lekeni mbuli tsangu ng'atsitsoluta mbe.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu imunu iyomanya litsuwa wala isaa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Malk 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Kuduhu imunu iyomanya litsuwa wala isaa ayo, hata wamalaika wa kulanga, wala Imwana, ila Aba yaliyeka iyomanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ka pfailawile mne ghamatsuwa gha Nuhu, itsakuwa pfipfo hayatsakutsa Imwana we Imunu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa agho ng'ana ghamafuliko ghalawile, iwanu tsawang'ali wakuja na ukunwa, wokwela na kukwelighwa mbaka litsuwa lya Nuhu hengile mne safina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Ng'awamanyile bae choni ching'alawile mbaka ghamafuliko ghatsa na kuwasola wose. Apfi pfipfo pfaitsolawila hayatsakutsa Imwana we Imunu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Iwanu weli watsakuwa kumghunda, yumwe katsosolighwa na yungi katsolekighwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Iwapinga weli watsotwanga hamwe, yumwe katsosolighwa na yungi katsolekighwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Apfo, mwalangitse, kwaapfila ng'ammanya bae litsuwa lyachi Imtwatsa wenu hayatsakutsa. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Lekeni mmanye apfi, ka mwenye kaye ang'amanyile imbapfi kakutsa tsuwachi, ang'akalile meso, na tsang'oileka bae ing'anda yake ibenighwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Pfipfila namwe mwiyandae, kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu katsakutsa mne isaa ng'amuilolele bae yatse.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumwa yotogholighwa na yang'otogholighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Kuya yuhi imtumwa yotogholighwa na yane ihekima? Ayula imtwatsa wake yamwikile yawemile iwatumwa wangi mne ing'anda yake na kuweng'a ichijo chawo chipindi chinoghile. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Kabweda imtumwa yula imtwatsa wake hayatsakuya na kumpfika kotenda apfo, <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nowalongelani ghendo, imtwatsa ayo katsomwika kwimilitsa ipfinu pfake pfose. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Lekeni ka mtumwa keha, na ang'elongela imwenyegho, ‘Imtwatsa wangu katsokawa kuya,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />kuya kakwandusa ukuwatowa iwatumwa weyaghe na ukuja na ukunwa hamwe ne iwanu iwopatika. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Imtwatsa we imtumwa ayo katsakutsa mne litsuwa lyang'omlolela bae na mne isaa yang'aimanyile bae. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Imtwatsa ayo katsomghana pfihindi pfihindi na katsomwika hamwe ne iwang'enye, ako kutsakuwa na chililo na kughegheda ghamatsino.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye wali kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Chipindi acho undewa wa kulanga witseghala ne wali kumi, iwasolile pfitasa pfawo na waghenda kumbokela imunu yokwela. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Watano mna wawo tsawabotsi, na watano wangi tsawana ihekima. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Awala wali wabotsi wosola pfitasa pfawo, lekeni ng'awasolile bae ghamafuta ghoghose. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Awala wane ihekima, wasola tsisupa itsimemile ghamafuta hamwe na pfitasa pfawo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Imunu yokwela tsakakawa kutsa, apfo wali wose wapata nongo, wawasa. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Chilo chikulu, kulawila litsi, ‘Imunu yokwela kapfika! Mlawe mkambokele!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Kuya wali wose walamka, watuwa pfitasa pfawo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Awala iwabotsi wawalongela awala wane ihekima, ‘Mtugholele ghamafuta ghenu chidogho kwaapfila pfitasa pfetu pfotsimika.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Lekeni awala wane ihekima wawedika, ‘Mbe, ng'aghotwenela bae twetwe na mwemwe, ghendani kwe iwanu iwohutsa ghamafuta mkaghule.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Lekeni hawang'ali woghenda kughula ghamafuta, imunu yokwela tsakapfika. Wali awala iweyandaye, wengila naye mng'anda mne chihungo cha ukukwela. Na libani lihindighwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Hambele chidogho wali wabotsi woya, walonga, ‘Imtwatsa! Imtwatsa! Utupfughulile libani!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Lekeni kawedika, ‘Nowalongelani ghendo, siwamanyile bae.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Kuya Yesu kalonga, “Apfo mkale meso, kwaapfila ng'ammanyile bae litsuwa au isaa.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye watumwa wadatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Pfipfila undewa wa kulanga witseghala ne imunu iyoghenda ghumwanza, iyawakemile iwatumwa wake na kuweka wemilitse tsimali tsake. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Kamwing'a chila yumwe kwa kulola uwetso wake, yumwe kamwing'a mikoba mitano, yungi mikoba mili, na yungi mkoba ghumwe. Kuya koka ghumwanza. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Bahala imtumwa iyabokele mikoba mitano kaghenda kutsitendela sang'ano, kapata mikoba mingi mitano. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Pfipfila, ayula iyabokele talanta mbili tsongetseka keli talanta mbili. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Lekeni ayula iyabokele talanta imwe, koka kahimba hasi, kaipfisa isendi ye imtwatsa wake.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Ghamatsuwa pfaghalutile, imtwatsa we iwatumwa awo koya na kwandusa kupeta tsisendi hamwe nawo. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Imtumwa iyabokele talanta tano kamghalila talanta tano tsingi, kalonga, ‘Imtwatsa, tsakungaya talanta tano, ulole tsongetseka talanta tsingi tano.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Imtwatsa wake kamwidika, ‘Kutenda ghoya, mtumwa yunoghile na mtogholighwa! Tsakutogholighwa kwa ipfinu pfidodo, nitsokwika wimilitse pfinu pfingi. Utse udeng'elele na mtwatsa wako!’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Kuya imtumwa iyeng'ighwe talanta mbili naye katsa, kalonga, ‘Imtwatsa tsakungaya talanta mbili, ulole, tsongetseka tsingi mbili.’<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />“Imtwatsa wake kamwidika, ‘Kutenda ghoya, imtumwa yunoghile na yutogholighwa! Tsakutogholighwa kwa pfinu pfidodo, nitsokwika wimilitse pfinu pfingi, utse na udeng'elele hamwe na mtwatsa wako!’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Kuya imtumwa iyabokele mkoba umwe katsa, kalonga, ‘Imtwatsa, nokumanya ghweghwe kwa imunu mkomu, kopfuna hanu ng'auhandile bae, na kokunga hanu ng'aupwililise bae tsimbeghu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Apfo tsanipfuka, mbuka kupfisa isendi yako mne lidongo. Ulole, aino iyo isendi yako.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Mtwatsa wake kamwidika, ‘Ghweghwe kwa imtumwa wihile na imdebwe! Tsakumanya ka nene nopfuna hanu sihandile na kukunga hanu sipwililise bae tsimbeghu. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Apfo tsakubamighwa kuika bengi isendi yangu, ili hambuile na nene nyambulile ifaida.<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />“ ‘Mumboke sendi ayo mmwing'e ayu yane mikoba kumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kwaapfila wowose iyalinacho, katsokongetsighwa, na wowose iyalihela chinu hata achila chayalinacho katsobokighwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Na mmwase imtumwa yuno yehile kunze mne ichisi, ako kutsakuwa na chililo na kughegheda ghamatsino.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwang'olo na iwamene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Imwana we Imunu hayatsakutsa mne utunitso wake, hamwe na wamalaika, katsokala mne chighoda chake che undewa mne utunitso wa kulanga. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Iwanu wa kolo tsose watsetingana hambele hake, naye katsowabaghula ka iwadimi pfawowabaghula iwang'olo na iwamene. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Katsoweka iwanu iwanoghile kune ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na iwanu wehile ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Kuya Imndewa katsowalongela awala iwakalile ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo, ‘Mtse, mwemwe imbalikighwe na Aba wangu, mhale undewa wamwikilighwe mwemwe kulawa iisi hailumbighwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kwaapfila tsanikala ne inzala, namwe mngaya ichijo, tsanikala ne ing'ilu, namwe mngaya ghamatsi, tsanamhenza namwe mnibokela. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Tsanahela lighwanda namwe mnipfetsa, tsanamtamu namwe mutsa kundola, tsanamchifungo, namwe mnyangila.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Baho iwanu iwanoghile watsomwidika, ‘Imtwatsa wetu tsuwachi hatukwonile kuna inzala na tukwing'a ichijo, au kuna ing'ilu na twetwe tukwing'a ghamatsi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Kuya tsuwachi hatukwonile kwa mhenza na twetwe tukubokela, au kwahela lighwanda na twetwe tukupfetsa? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Tsuwachi hatukwonile kwa mtamu au kwa mchifungo na twetwe tukwangila?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Imndewa katsowedika, ‘Nowalongelani ghendo, chochose chamumtendele yumwe wa wano wandughu tsangu, mnendela nene.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Kuya katsowalongela awala iwali kune ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso, ‘Lawani hana nene, yamlighitighwe, mghende kune ghumoto ghwa ghamatsuwa ghose, ighwikighwe kwaajili ya Yehile ne malaika wake! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kwaapfila tsanikala ne inzala ng'amngaile bae ichijo, tsanina ing'ilu ng'amngaile bae ghamatsi, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Tsanamhenza, ng'amnibokele bae, tsanahela lighwanda, ng'amnipfetse bae. Tsanamtamu na tsanamchifungo, ng'amtsile bae kumbona.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Kuya nawo watsamwidika, ‘Imtwatsa, tsuwachi hatukwonile kuna inzala au kuna ing'ilu, au kwamhenza au kwahela lighwanda au kwamtamu au kwa mne chifungo, na twetwe ng'atukwapfile bae?’<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />“Imndewa naye katsowedika, ‘Nowalongelani ghendo, ka tsamlema kumwapfila yumwe we iwadodo wano, tsamlema kunyapfila nene.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Kuya watsoghenda kune ukughaya kwa ghamatsuwa ghose, lekeni iwanu iwanoghile watsoghenda kune ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Inzila ye ukumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu hayamalitse kulonga mbuli atso, kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Ka pfammanya ghatsuwa meli hambele itsakuwa Pasaka, na Imwana we Imunu katsoghoghighwa ili awambighwe mna msalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Kuya iwatambika wakulu na iwakulu watingana mne ing'anda ye imlapfa inambiko mkulu, taghwa lyake Kayafa, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />tsawabama inzila ya kumghogha Yesu chinyelenyele wamkome. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Walonga, “Lekeni ileke kutendeka mne chihungo, hela kutsolawila hengele.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobakighwa ghamafuta ako Betaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Malk 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu hayang'ali Betaniya mne ing'anda ya Simoni mkoma, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />pinga yumwe kamghendela ne isupa ya alabasta iimemile ghamafuta ighonung'ila gha bei ng'ulu, kamghela mwitwi hayang'ali yakuja mmetsa. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Iwanang'ina hawonile apfo wona maya, waghutsa, “Angu choni kwaghitsa ghamafuta pfino?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />“Ghamafuta ghano ghang'autsighwe kwa bei ng'ulu, tsisendi weng'ighwe iwahingwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu tsakamanya chawang'ali wolonga, kawalongela, “Ule mwomdesa ipinga ayu? Kanendela chinu chinoghile. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Iwahingwa mtsokala nawo ghamatsuwa ghose, lekeni ng'amtsokala bae na nene ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Hayanighele ghamafuta ighonung'ila mlukuli mwangu, katenda apfo kuniyandaa kwa ukutsikighwa kwangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Nowalongelani ghendo, kokose imbuli inoghile haitsopetighwa mne iisi yose, chayatendile ipinga yuno chitsopetighwa kwa kumkumbuka yeye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotoghola kumuhunduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Malk 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Kuya Yuda Isikarioti yumwe we awala iwanang'ina kumi na weli, kawaghendela iwatambika wakulu, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />kawaghutsa, “Ning'awapfila ukumhunduka Yesu, mtsongaya choni?” Wampetela tsisendi selasini, wamwing'a. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kulawa baho, Yuda yang'ali yobama inzila ya kumuhunduka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakuja ichijo che Paska ne iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Malk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Mne litsuwa lye mwanduso lye Chihungo che Ipfighate ipfihela hamila, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela Yesu, wamghutsa, “Kobama tukutandile kwani ichijo che Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Kawedika, “Mghende mne ghumji kwa imunu yumwe mumlongele, ‘Imlangulitsi kolonga chipindi changu chahabehi. Nene na iwanang'ina wangu tutsakuja Pasaka mng'anda mwako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Apfo iwanang'ina watenda ka Yesu pfayawalongele, na waitanda Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Nemihe haipfikile, Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli wakala mmetsa wakuja. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Hawang'ali wakuja, kawalongela, “Nowalongelani ghendo, yumwe wenu katsonihunduka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Iwanang'ina tsawona usungu, chila yumwe kandusa kumlongela Yesu, “Apfi nene Imtwatsa?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu kawalongela, “Imunu iyopfabika chighate chake hamwe na nene mne ibakuli, katsonihunduka. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Imwana we imunu katsokufa ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga. Lekeni katsoghaya imunu yula iyomhunduka Imwana we Imunu. Ing'awile ng'apfu kwe imunu ka ayo ka ng'elekighwe bae.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda, ayula iyabamile kumhunduka Yesu, kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, si nene bae.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kulonga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichijo cha nemihe che Imtwatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Malk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wak 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Hawang'ali wakuja, Yesu kasola ichighate, kachibaliki, kachibena kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake, kalonga, “Msole mje, aluno lukuli Iwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Kuya kasola chikombe, kachibaliki, kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake, kalonga, “Wose mnwele chikombe achi.” <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />“Aino iyo idamu yangu ye lilaghano, iikwitike kwaajili ya wengi kuleghusighwa nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nowalongelani, sitsakunwa keli bae idipfai mbaka litsuwa lila hanitsoinwa idipfai ya sambi na mwemwe mne undewa wa Aba wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Hawamalitse kwimba wila, woka, waghenda kune Chidunda cha Mitseituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga Petiri katsombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Chilo chino mtsotsuma na kundeka, ka pfayandikighwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">Nitsomtowa imdimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">na iwang'olo we likingili watsopwililika,<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Lekeni hanitsotsilihuka, nitsowalongolani Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petiri kamwidika, “Hata wose wang'akuleka, nene sikuleka bae.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu kamlongelela Petiri, “Nokulongela ghendo, chilo chino ng'ana ijogholo yeke, kutsombela mala ndatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petiri kamwidika, “Sikubela bae, hata ka nobamighwa nife naghwe.” Na iwanang'ina wose walonga pfipfo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolomba ako Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Malk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Kuya Yesu kaghenda ne iwanang'ina wake hanu hakemighwe Getisemane, kawalongela, “Mkale hano, nene noghenda hala kulomba.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Kamsola Petiri na iwana weli wa Sebedayo, kuya kandusa kwona usungu, na kughanzika. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Kawalongela, “Ghumoyo ghwangu ghuna usungu mwingi, mbaka nobama nife. Mkale hano na mkale meso na nene.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Kaghenda hambele chidogho, katowa maghoti, kenama mbaka chihanga chake chighusa hasi, kalomba, “Aba wangu, ka yodahika, uchileghuse chikombe chino che maghayo kuna nene. Lekeni si ka nene pfanibama, ila ka pfaubama ghweghwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Kuya kawoyila iwanang'ina wake, kawapfika wawasa. Kamghutsa Petiri, “Angu ng'amdahile bae kukala meso na nene hata kwa isaa imwe?” <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />“Mkale meso, mlombe ili mleke kwingila mne maghetso, ghumoyo ghwobama, lekeni lukuli lwahela ingupfu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Kaghenda lwakeli, kalomba, “Aba wangu, ka ng'aidahika bae kuchileghusa ichikombe chino che maghayo mbaka nichinwe, ghoubama ghweghwe ghatendeke.”<verse eid="MAT 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Hayohile lwa keli, kawapfika keli wawasa kwaapfila nenge tsawo ng'atsidahile bae kukala meso. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Kawaleka koka keli, na kalomba lwa kadatu, kalonga chinu chichila.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Kuya kawoyila iwanang'ina wake kawalongela, “Angu mng'ali mwowasa na kubwihila? Mlole, isaa ya habehi, na Imwana we Imunu kakwing'ighwa kwe iwanu wane nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Mwinuke, tukeni! Hayo kakutsa iyonihunduka!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Malk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Hayang'ali yolonga apfo, Yuda yumwe we iwanang'ina kumi na weli, kapfika ne iwanu wengi iwakindile imimaghe ne ipfilungu, tsawatumighwa na iwatambika wakulu na iwakulu we iwanu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yuda tsakaweng'a chitango. “Imunu yanimnonela iyo yuyo yamumbama, mghogheni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Bahala Yuda kamghendela Yesu, kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, nokulamsa!” Kuya kamnonela.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu kamlongela, “Sale yangu, utende achila chautsile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Kuya iwanu awo wamghendela Yesu, wamkinda, wamghogha. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Yumwe we awala iwakalile na Yesu kagholosa ghumoko ghwake, kasomola limaghe lyake, kamtowa imtumwa we imtambika mkulu, kamghana lighutwi.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yesu kamlongela, “Uyitse limaghe hanu hake, kwaapfila awala wose iwokinda limaghe watsakufa kwa limaghe. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Angu ng'ammanyile bae ka ning'adahile kumlomba Aba wangu, naye ang'anighalile makingili ghe asikali kubita kumi na meli ghe wamalaika watse kunyapfila. <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Lekeni lelo ghatsotimilatse Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka igholonga, yobamighwa ilawile pfino?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Bahala Yesu kawalongela iwanu wala, “Angu mutsa na mimaghe na pfilungu kungogha, ka nene na mbapfi? Chila litsuwa tsanikala namwe na nilangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, ng'amnighoghile bae. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Lekeni agha ghose ghalawila ili ghawandikile manabii ghatimile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Kuya iwanang'ina wake wamleka, watsuma.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hambele he libalatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Malk 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohn 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Awala iwamghoghile Yesu wamghala kwa Kayafa, imtambika mkulu, kwawatinganile iwolangulitsa ghamalaghitso ne iwakulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Lekeni, Petiri kamuwinza kwa kutali mbaka hachitala he mtambika mkulu. Kengila mghati, kakala hasi na iwabetetsi, yalole choni chitsolawila.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Iwabala we inambiko na Libalatsa lyose wang'ali wobama ukalangama we ughutsu kwaajili ya Yesu, ili wadahe kumkoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Lekeni ng'awapatile ukalangama wowose bae, hata ka iwakalangama wengi we ughutsu watsa hambele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:60">Kuya iwanu weli watsa hambele, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />walonga, “Imunu yuno kalonga apfi, ‘Nodaha kuimwagha Ing'anda ye Imulungu na kuitsenga keli mne ghamatsuwa madatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Kuya mtambika mkulu kenuka kamlongela Yesu, “Kwahela che ukwidika? Agha ighawolonga iwanu wano gholongesa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Lekeni Yesu kanyamala. Mtambika mkulu, kamlongela, “Wilahe kwe Imulungu iyali mghima. Utulongele ka ghweghwe kwa Kiristu, Imwana we Imulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwolonga. Lekeni nowalongelani wose, kulawa sambi na kughendelela mtsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakala ubali wa kujilo we Imulungu Yane ingupfu, kakutsa mne ghamawingu gha kulanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Bahala Mtambika mkulu kadegha ghamaghwanda ghake kalonga, “Kaligha! Ule lelo twobama keli wakalangama? Mwemwe wenyegho mmuhulika pfayalighile. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Mwemwe mkonatse?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Wamwidika, “Katotsa, yakomighwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Wambwalulila ghamate mchihanga na wamtowa. Wamwenga wamtowa makofi. <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Walonga, “Ghwe Kiristu, utange yuhi yakutowile?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Malk 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohn 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petiri tsakakala kunze mwe chikuta, na imtumwa yumwe pinga kamghendela, kamlongela, “Naghwe pfipfila tsakwahamwe na Yesu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Lekeni Petiri kabela hambele ha wose, kalonga, “Simanyile bae chaulonga?”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Kuya kalawa kunze, ako imtumwa yungi pinga kamwona, kuya kawalongela iwanu, “Hayuno naye tsakahamwe na Yesu wa Natsareti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petiri kabela keli, kwa kwilaha, “Simmanyile bae imunu ayo!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Hambele chidogho, awala iwemile hala wamghendela Petiri walonga, “Naghwe kwa yumwe wawo ghendo, kwaapfila hata kulonga kwako kolangusa ghweghwe kwa Mgalilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Kuya Petiri kandusa kwilighita na kwilaha, kalonga, “Mbe, simmanyile bae imunu ayo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Bahala ijogholo keka, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />na Petiri kakumbuka imbuli iyailongile Yesu. “Ijogholo ng'ana yeke, kutsombela mala ndatu.” Kalawa kunze, kalila kwa usungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Malk 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohn 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Nemitondotondo, iwatambika wakulu ne iwakulu we iwanu wose tsawalamla kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Wamwoha, wamlongotsa wamghala kwa Pilato, mkulu wa isi iyasaghulighwe ne mkulu Roma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifwa lya Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Ghama 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yuda, iyamhunduke Yesu, hayonile Yesu kahighighwa, kona usungu katsuyitsa sendi tsila selasini tsayasolile kwe iwatambika wakulu. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Kawalongela, “Nitotsa, kwaapfila nimhunduka imunu iyalihela totso yakomighwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Lekeni wawo wamwidika, “Twetwe ng'atukwalangula bae, alyo lyako.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Apfo Yuda kasa sendi atso mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, kuya kaghenda kwikoma kwa kwibota imwenyegho. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Iwatambika wakulu wadondola sendi tsila, walonga, “Ng'apfinoghile bae kwika sendi tsino mne hatsina ye Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kwaapfila atsino sendi tsa idamu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Apfo walamla sendi atso waghulile mghunda wa wafina pfiha uwe hanu he kutsikila iwahenza. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ndo mana mbaka leloli mghunda awo wokemighwa, “Mghunda wa Damu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Kuya achila chayalongile nabii Yeremiya chitimila, “Watsosola sendi selasini, tsawatoghole iwanu wa Isiraeli kumlihila, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />watsitumila kughulila mghunda we wafina pfiha, ka Imtwatsa pfayanilaghitse.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato komghutsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Malk 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohn 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu tsakema hambele ha imkulu wa Roma, na imkulu ayo kamghutsa, “Angu ghweghwe kwa Imndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kolonga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Iwabala we inambiko ne iwakulu hawang'ali womwing'a ghamaghomba, ng'edike chochose bae. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Kuya Pilato kamghutsa, “Angu ng'uhulika bae ghamaghomba ghano ghowokulonga?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Lekeni Yesu ng'edike imbuli yoyose bae, mkulu ayo kakangawala ghendo.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohighighwa yakomighwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Malk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohn 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Chila chihungo che Paska imkulu wa Roma katsowela kumlekelela imwohingwa yumwe, iyawambamile iwanu. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Tsahana mwohighwa yumwe, iyamanyike ng'ani yakemighwe Baraba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Apfo iwanu hawetingane, Pilato kawaghutsa, “Mwobama nimlekelele yuhi? Baraba au Yesu yokemighwa Kiristu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Kwaapfila Pilato tsakamanya ghendo ka wamghala Yesu kuna yeye, kwaapfila tsawamwonela chepfu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato hayang'ali kakala mne chighoda cha kuhighila, mwehe wake kamtumila usenga, “Uleke kumtendela chochose imunu ayo yalihela totso. Kwaapfila leloli nechilo tsanidununzika ng'ani mndoto kwaajili yake.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Lekeni iwabala we inambiko na iwakulu, waghusongesa mtingano we iwanu wamlombe Pilato amlekelele Baraba na Yesu yakomighwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pilato kawaghutsa keli, “Yuhi mna wano weli mwombama nimlekelele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Wamwidika, “Baraba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato kawaghutsa, “Lelo nimtende choni ayu Yesu yokemighwa Kiristu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Wose wamwidika, “Umuwambe mna msalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato kawaghutsa, “Ule? Choni chihile chayatendile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Lekeni wose wakemelela hamwe, “Umuwambe mna msalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato hayonile ng'odaha bae chochose, ne hengele tsalyakwandusa kulawila, kasola ghamatsi, kahopfugha ghamoko ghake hambele he iwanu, kalonga, “Nene nahela litotso kwa ukufa kwe imunu ayu, alyo lyenu iwenyegho!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Iwanu wose walonga, “Totso lye ukufa kwake liwe mchanya mwetu na mchanya mwe iwanetu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Kuya kamlekelela Baraba kuna wawo. Lekeni kalonga wampfapule Yesu na mijeledi, kamlapfa yawambighwe mna msalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asikali wombetsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Malk 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohn 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Kuya asikali wa Pilato wamghala Yesu mne ing'anda ye imndewa, na kingili lyose lye asikali limmemela. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Wamtsula ghamaghwanda ghake, wampfatsa lighwanda dung'u, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Kuya wabota fiya ya tsimiwa walika mwitwi mwake, kuya weka ing'weku mne ghumoko ghwake wa kujilo, watowa ghamaghoti hambele hake. Wambetsa, walonga, “Mbukwa, Imndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Wambwalulila ghamate, wasola ing'weku wamtowa mwitwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Hawamalitse kumbetsa, wamtsula lighwanda alyo, wampfatsa ghamaghwanda ghake. Wamghala yawambighwe mna msalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambighwa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Hawang'ali wakuka, watingana ne imunu yumwe iyolawila Kirene, iyakemighwe Simoni, wamnanahitsa yaughale msalaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Wapfika hanu hokemighwa Goligota, mana yake Chibombwe che Litwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Wamwing'a Yesu idipfai iitifighwe ne ichinu che usungu, lekeni hayailanzile, kalema ukunwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Wamuwamba mna msalaba, kuya wegholela ghamaghwanda ghake kwa kutowa simbi. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Wakala hasi wamlolesa. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Na hachanya he litwi lyake, wandika lighomba lyake, “Ayuno Yesu, Imndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Iwabapfi weli nawo tsawawambighwa hamwe naye, yumwe ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na yungi ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Iwanu iwalutile hala, wahighitsa ghamatwi ghawo kwa kumbetsa, wamligha, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />walonga, “Ambe ghweghwe ung'aimwaghile Ing'anda ye Imulungu na kuitsenga keli mne ghamatsuwa madatu! Lelo wikombole imwenyeng'o. Ka ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu hulumka mna msalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Pfipfila iwatambika wakulu na iwolangulitsa ghamalaghitso, na iwabala wose wambesa. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />Walonga, “Kawakombola iwanu wangi, lekeni ng'odaha bae kwikombola imwenyegho, ambe yeye ka Imndewa we Isiraeli, tumlole lelo yahulumke mna msalaba, na twetwe tutsomtoghola. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Tsakamuhuwila Imulungu na kalonga ‘Nene na Imwana we Imulungu.’ Lekani lelo tulole Imulungu yamkombole ka kombama.”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Pfipfila iwabapfi weli iwawambighwe hamwe naye, wamligha.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kulawa saa sita mbaka saa tisa ichisi tsachighubika isi yose. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Haipfikile saa tisa, Yesu kakemelela, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Mana yake, “Imulungu wangu, Imulungu wangu, ebali kondeka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Iwanu iwemile hala hawahulike apfo, walonga, “Komkema Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 27:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Bahala yumwe wawo katsuma kasola dodoki, kalika mne dipfai iing'ang'a, kuya kalika mne ing'weku kamwing'a Yesu yainwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Awala iwanu wangi walonga, “Lelo mleke tulole ka Eliya kakutsa kumkombola.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu kakemelela keli kwa litsi likulu, kuya kafa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Bahala lipatsiya ililimghati mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu lidegheka pfihindi pfibili kulawa uchang'a mbaka hasi. Isi tsaidedema na ghamabambalawe ghatulika. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />tsikabuli tsighubuka ne iwanu wengi we Imulungu iwafile tsawatsilihuka. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Walawa kunze mwe tsikabuli, na Yesu hayatsilihuke waghenda mne ghumji mwenzeluka, na iwanu wengi wawona.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Ayula imkulu we asikali na awala iwakalile naye womkalitsa Yesu, hawonile isi ihighisika na ghose ighalawile, tsawapfuka, walonga, “Ayuno tsa Imwana we Imulungu ghendo!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Tsakukala na iwapinga wengi, wololesa kwa kutali, awo iwo iwamuwinzile Yesu kulawa Galilaya na iwamwapfile. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mna wawo, tsakukala na Mariya Magidalena, Mariya mai wawo tsina Jakobu na Yosefu na mai we iwana wa Sebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsikighwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Nemihe haipfikile, imunu yumwe tajiri kulawa Arimataya iyakemighwe Yosefu kapfika, naye imwenyegho tsakakala mwanang'ina wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Kamghendela Pilato kamlomba yamwing'e lukuli lwa Yesu, na Pilato kalaghitsa yeng'ighwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosefu kalusola lukuli, kalupfatsa isanda inoghile, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />kalwika hanu hake imwenyegho ha sambi ha kutsikila. Kuya kabingilisa libwe kulu hambele he libani lye likabuli, kuya koka. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariya Magidalena na Mariya yungi tsawakala baho, welolesa ne likabuli.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asikali hane likabuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Litsuwa lya keli, ilili litsuwa lya Sabato, iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo waghenda kwa Pilato. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Walonga, “Imndewa, twokumbuka mghutsu yula, hayang'ali mghima tsakalonga, ‘Ghang'abita ghamatsuwa madatu, nitsotsilihuka keli.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Apfo, ulaghitse kabuli lyake walikalitse ghoya mbaka mne litsuwa lya kadatu. Hela iwanang'ina wake wodaha kutsa na kulwiba lukuli lwake na kuwalongela iwanu kuwa katsilihuka. Ughutsu uno wa utsighilo utsakuwa wiha kubita ula wa mwanduso.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato kawedika, “Mnawo asikali, mghende mkakalitse likabuli ka pfamdaha.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Apfo woka na wakalitsa ghoya likabuli kwa kwika chitango mne libwe na wawaleka asikali wokalitsa.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kutsilihuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Malk 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Litsuwa lya Sabato halimalile, lupfilipfili litsuwa lye mwanduso lye lijuma, Mariya Magidalena na Mariya yungi waghenda kulola likabuli.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Tsakulawila mdedemo mkulu we isi, kwaapfila malaika we Imtwatsa tsakahulumka kulawa kulanga, kaghenda mne likabuli kalibingilisa libwe hambali, kalikalila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Chihanga chake tsachikala ka lumwesa, na lighwanda lyake tsalitselu chwee! <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Iwanu iwang'ali wokalitsa wapfuka ghendo, wadedema na woneka ka wafa.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Malaika ayo kawalongela iwapinga, “Mleke kupfuka, kwaapfila nomanya mwombama Yesu iyawambighwe mna msalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Ng'alibaha bae, katsilihuka ka pfayalongile. Mtse mlole hanu hayawasile. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Lelo msumke mghende, muwalongelele pfino iwanang'ina wake. ‘Yesu katsilihuka, naye katsowalongola kughenda Galilaya. Baho mtsomwona.’ Haya lelo, ma niwalongela.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Apfo iwapinga awo wasumka kuka kulawa hane likabuli, kwa kupfuka na ndeng'elelo ng'ulu, watsuma waghenda kuwalongela iwanang'ina wake.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Bahala Yesu ketingana nawo, kawalongela, “Nowalamsani.” Wamghendela, wakinda ghamaghulu ghake, wamtamanila. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Mleke kupfuka. Mghende mkawalongele wandughu tsangu waghende Galilaya, ako watsombona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwakalitse likabuli wolonga ichilawile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Iwapinga hawang'ali wamnzila, asikali wangi mna awala iwakalitse likabuli waghenda kune ghumji wawalongela watambika wakulu chila chinu ichilawile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Iwakulu we inambiko hawetingane ne iwabala wapanga imbuli yawo, waweng'a sendi nyingi awala iwakalitse likabuli, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />kuya wawalongela, “Walongeleni pfino iwanu, ‘Iwanang'ina wake watsa nechilo, wamwiba hatuwasile.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Na imkulu we isi ang'ahulika mbuli ino, twetwe tutsolonga naye, namwe ng'amtsokwingila mne maghayo.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Apfo awala asikali wasola sendi, na watenda ka pfawalongelighwe. Na mbuli ayo yenela kwe Wayahudi mbaka leloli.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ghama 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Kuya iwanang'ina kumi na yumwe waghenda Galilaya kune chidunda, ako Yesu kwayawalongele waghende. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Hawamwonile, wamtamanila lekeni wangi wapfuka. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu kawaghendela, kawalongela, “Ukulu wose uli kulanga na uli muisi ning'ighwa nene. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Apfo, mghende mkawatende iwanu we isi tsose wawe wanang'ina wangu, muwabatitse kwa taghwa lya Aba na Imwana na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />na muwalangulitse kughakinda aghala ghose ghaniwalaghitse. Na nene na hamwe namwe ghamatsuwa ghose mbaka iisi haitsomala.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>